<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim muoltung gama Rama-thaim ah Ephraim mi Zuph’ tapa Tohu, a tapa Elihu, a tapa Jeroham, a tapa Elkanah a kici mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in zi ni nei hi; khat’ min Hanah ahi a, a khat’ min Peninah ahi hi. Peninah in ta nei a, ahi vangin Hannah in nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kumkumin ama’ khuo panin tam mipa Eli’ tapa nite Hophni le Phinehas in Topa’ siempu a sepna uh mun Shiloh ah Vanglien Topa bie ding le biehpiehna pie dingin kato zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni-in Elkanah in biehpiehna a lui ciengin a zi Peninnah le a tanute a tapate zosie tungah tanh a pie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahi vangin ama in Hannah tungah tanh ni a pie hi, azieh pen Topa in a naubu khahpieh zongle ama in Hannah it veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a naubu a khahpieh ziehin alang nu in a lungthah thei nadingin ama nahpitahin a phin zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n kum sielin tuaci den uhi; Topa’ inn ah a kato sielun ama in tua nu a phin zel hi. Tua ahi ziehin Hannah kapin an ne lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pasal Elkanah in, “Hannah, bang zieha kap na hiei? Bang dinga an na neh lo ahiei? Bang dinga lungkham na hiei? Nang adingin tapa sawm sangin manphazaw hi lo ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shiloh ah a neh a dawn zaw ciengun Hannah ding dawhin Topa mai-ah ama le ama a kipulah hi. Tua laitahin Topa’ biehinn khuom pangah siempu Eli na to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama nah lungkham mama a, Topa kungah thu ngenin nahpi tahin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua nu in tami kiciemna a bawl hi: “Vanglien Topa aw, na nasemnu’ lunggimna ei enin nei phawh a, keima ei mangngil loin na nasemnu tungah nausen pata khat nei pieh leh, a si dongin na mai-ah nazir mi-in kang ap ding hi. Ama in zu hile khamtheite hile dawn lo ding a, a lu tungah mulmetna tukha lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa mai-ah ama thu ngenin a op laitahin, Eli in tua nu’ kam na en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hannah in dai dide-in thu ngen hi; a nephu beh pia-in a aw kiza lo hi; tua ahi ziehin Eli in zukhamin a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Eli in ama kungah, “Bang tanvei zukhamin mite’ nuisatin om ding na hei? Na zuneh khawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle Hannah in, “Hi lo hi, ka pu aw, mi lungkham le mi liengvai numei khat ka hi hi; lenggazu hile khamtheizu hile ka ciem vawt sih a, Topa mai-a ka lungsim teng a sunghla dawh ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lo numei danin ei ngaisun sin, azieh pen ka lung a gim seng le ka cimaw nah seng zieha a ham ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Eli in, “Lungmuongin pei in; Israel-te’ Pasien in ama tunga na ngetsa thu ang pie hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Na mitmu-in na nasemnu maipha ei musah in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin numei nu zong a opna munah pei-in a pasal tawh an ne tui dawnin a om a, a maisuo in da mai a puo nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zingmawngin amate thobai-in Topa mai-ah a bie uhi; tua ciengin Ramah-a a inn vuah amate a peikia uhi. Elkanah in a zi Hannah luppi a, Topa in ama a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hun a cin ciengin Hannah gai-in tapa khat nei hi. Ama in a min Samuel a phuoh hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua nu in, “Ama Topa tunga ka nget ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elkanah le a innkuonpite zosie Topa tungah kumsim biehpiehna le a thuciemna pie dingin a kato uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Hannah a peito sih hi; bang ding ahei cile ama in a pasal kungah, “Naungeh in nawi a tan behin Topa opna-ah kilaa-in tua munah a op suoh zing thei nadingin ka zawpi ding hi; tawntunga nazir-in ama ka ap ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama’ pasal Elkanah in ama kungah, “Hoi na sah pen bangin bawl inlen, a nawi tan dong ngah in; Topa in a kammal hing kipsah taheh,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n numei nu omin nawi a tansah masangsie a tapa a khoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua nu in nawi a tansah zaw ciengin, kum thum a pha bawngtang khat, annel ephah khat, le lenggazu savun thawl khat tawh ama a zawpito hi. Tua nu in Shiloh-a Topa’ inn ah ama peipi hi; tua naupang khangdawng lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in bawngtang go-in Eli kungah naupang a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Aw ka pupa! Nang a hingzing na hi ma bangin ka pupa aw, kei pen Topa tungah thungenin na opna tam sunga a ding numei ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam naupang adingin thu ka nget ziehin Topa in ama tunga ka thungetna ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama pen Topa ka kawm zo hi. A hin laisie Topa tungah ama a kipie ahi ta hi,” a ci hi. Tua nu in khum munah Topa adingin ama a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hannah in thu ngen a, “ Topa sungah lungdamin ka kipah hi; ka Pasien sungah ka hatna kitawisang hi. Ka guolzawna sungah ka kipah ziehin, ka kam in ka galte ka simmaw bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa banga a Siengtho koima om lo a, nang simlo koima dang a om sih hi; I Pasien tawh kibang Suongpi dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kiphatsahna kam ham nawn sinlen, na kam sung panin kilietsahna pusuohsah nawn sin; bang zieh ahei cile Topa khu a thei Pasien hi a, gamtatnate ama tawh a kitawikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thahatte’ thaltang kikuoitan a, hinanle mi hatlote a thahat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A gilvate in a neh ding a thalaw vua, a gilkielte gilva zawsop uhi. Ta nei lo nu in ta sagi nei a, hinanle ta tam nei nu a lung a zuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in thatin hingsahkia hi; ama in Misikhuo ah peipi suhin a thotosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in zawngsahin hausah hi; ama in niemkhieh suhin ama in a domsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in leivui panin mizawngte phongto a; ama in ninphuol panin mi tasamte lamto hi. Uliente tawh amate totonsah a, amate a zatahhuoi tona a luosah hi. Azieh pen leitung khuompite Topa -a’ hi a, tuate tungah ama in leitung koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama in thuman mite’ kalsuonna encih a, ahi vangin migilote ahileh khuomiel lahah kisumang ding hi; azieh pen thagum hatna tawh mi guolzo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa ! Ama a langpangte kivatmai ding hi; vantungah Sangpen Pa in vantosah ding hi. Leimongte dongin Topa in thu a khen ding hi; ama in a kumpipa tungah thahatna pie ding a, a sathau nupa’ vanglietna a tawisang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ramah-a a inn ah Elkanah pei a, tua laitahin siempu Eli’ opna-ah naupang pa in Topa’ na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in Eli’ tapate pen mi ginalote ahi uhi; amate in Topa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mite tunga siempute’ nasep dingte ahi zongin a thusim sih uhi. Mi khatpo in biehpiehna a pieh ciengin, a sa a so laitahin a khutah siakeu kathum nei khat tawi-in siempu pa’ nasempa pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale ama in a siakeu tawh khangbel ahi a, niengbel ahi a, belpi ahi a, bel sung ahi zongin a sunsuh hi; siakeuka dawna a baang zosie siempupa in ama adingin a la hi. Shiloh-ah a pei Israel-te zosie tungah tam bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua banah a thau a kihal masangin siempu pa’ nasem khat pei-in biehna pie mipa kungah, “Siempupa ading em ding satel ei pie in; azieh pen ama in nang tung pan sa minsa ang sang sih ding a, a siel vateh ang sang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale mipa in ama kungah, “A thau ei hal masasah inlen, tua ciengin na dei zaza kilah ta’n,” a ci leh ama in, “Hi lo e, tu mama-in ei pie’n; nei pieh sih leh kang paulahpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam bangin Topa muna-ah tangvalte’ khielna a sie huoi mama hi; azieh pen amate in Topa’ biehnate a simmaw bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samuel pen saihadiel siempu puon a sil, Topa mai-a nasem naupang khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nu in ama adingin puontuol neu khat a gatpieh let a, kumsiel biehna pie dingin a pasal tawh a peito ciengin ama kungah kum simin a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Eli in Elkanah le a zi thupha pie a, “Ama in Topa tunga a pieh tami letsong tangin Topa in nang tam numei tawh ta nei dingin hing thuhkia taheh,” a ci hi; tua ciengin a inn vuah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale Topa in Hannah phawh a, ama gai-in tapa thum le tanu ni a nei hi. Topa opna-ah naupang Samuel a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in Eli a vuoi mama ta hi. Ama in Israel-te zosie tungah a tapate gamtatdan teng le a nasem numeite tawh kikhopna puonbuh kotbienga a luptonna thu zosie a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Bang dingin tua bang silte pi na bawl tahlawm uh ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie tung panin na gamtatsietnate uh ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi lo hi, ka tapate aw, Topa’ mite in a genthang kawikawi uh ka thu zahte a hoi vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khat in midang khat tunga a khiel leh ama dingin Topa tungah mi khat in thumpieh thei hi; ahi vangin mi khat Topa tungah khiel leh koi in thumpieh thei ding ahei?” a ci hi. Ahi vangin a pate uh’ thu a mang sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate a kitha ding pen Topa’ deina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in naupang Samuel a pumpi khanglien a, tuaci’n ama in Topa le mite’ maipha a nga toto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Eli kungah Pasien’ mi khat pei-in, “ Topa in, ‘Egypt gama Pharaoh’ khut nei-ah salin a op lai-un a pupi le a innkuonte kungah keima le keima ka kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel minam zosie lah panin ka maitam-a gimnamtui hal ding, le ka mai-ah siempu puon silin ka siempu dingin ama ka teel hi; tuale keima in Israel mite tung pana mei tawh kihal keima ei kibiehna zosie na pupi innkuon tungah ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bang dingin keima ei kibiehnate le ka thupieh ahi keima ei kipie biehnate dugaw etin , ka mi Israel-te’ pieh a tuituoh pen teng tawh kivahthau-in, kei sangin na tapate patawizaw na hei?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ziehin Israel-te’ Pasien Topa in a tangko hi: ‘Na innkuonpi le na pu na pate’ innkuonpite ka mai-ah a sungtum a pusuoh thei zing ding uhi,’ a ci hi; ahi vangin tu-in Topa in a tangko hi: ‘Tua bang hi thei nawn lo ding hi; bang ding ahei cile kei ei patawite ka patawi ding a, kei ei simmawte ka simmaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />En in, na innkuon sungah tehsie khat beh a om lo nadingin na innsung le na pa inn sungah thahatna ka suhmaimang hun ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in Israel-te tunga ka pieh daupeinate na lungkham hunin dugawna mit tawh na en ding hi; na innkuon sungah tehsie om ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka maitam pana ka hepkhiet lo ding note lahah khat, ama’ hlitui a luongsah ding le ama a lunggim sah dingin kihingkhawi ding hi; na innkuonpite zosie a unpi-in namsau tawh si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na tapa nite, Hophni le Phinehas tunga tung ding thu khu nang adingin ciemtena lim ahi ding a, ni khat thu-in a ni-in a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka lungtang sung le ka lungsim sunga om banga sem dingin a citah siempu khat keima dingin ka khangsah ding hi. Innkuon buldetin ama ka siem ding a, ka sathau nupa’ mai-ah sungtumin pusuoh zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na innkuon sunga a suohta laite in ngun peh khat hile, anlum lomkhat hile a ngen ding in a kungah pei-in, ‘An themkhat ka nei thei nadingin siempupa’ opna mun khat popo-ah ei koi in, ci-in kang thum hi, ci ding uhi,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Eli’ khut nei-ah naupang Samuel in Topa’ na a sem hi. Tua hun lai-in Topa’ thu cieu mama hi; mangmuna zong om zep lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hunin a mit mang dinga a kipan zo Eli in khuo mu thei loin a lupna-ah lum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien’ meivah mit nai lo a, Pasien’ singkuong opna Topa’ biehinn sungah Samuel lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “ Samuel! Samuel!” ci-in hlan a, tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing!” ci-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eli kungah tai a, tuale ama in, “Nei hlat ziehin tanah ka om hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “Kang hlan kha sih hi, ka tapa; lumkia ta’n,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama pei-in a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “Samuel!” ci-in hlankia hi. Samuel tho-in Eli kungah pei a, ama in, “Nei hlat ziehin tanah ka om hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “Kang hlan sih hi, ka ta aw; lumkia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hun lai tahin Samuel in Topa thei nai lo a, Topa in ama hopi ngai nai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Samuel a thumveina hlankia hi. Tuale ama tho-in Eli kungah pei a, “Nei hlat ziehin kei tanah ka om hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Topa in naupangpa hlan hi, ci Eli in a thei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Eli in Samuel kungah, “Pei inlen valum ta’n; ama in ang hlat leh, ‘ Topa aw, ei gen in, na nasempa in a ngai hi,’ na ci ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Samuel pei-in a opna ah a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa pei-in tua tahah ding a, a masa lai-a bangin “Samuel! Samuel!” ci-in a hlan hi. Samuel in, “Gen in, na nasempa in a ngai hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Samuel kungah, “En in, Israel gamah bang khat ka bawl ding a, tua thu a za mi vannuoi ciza lia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuami ni-in ama’ innkuon tungtang ka gensa zosie a patna pan a tawp tanpha-in Eli tungah ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tapate in Pasien’ mindaisah a, a tate’ khielna thei napi ama in a khaam lo ziehin kumtawnin ama’ innsung gimna ka pieh ding thu ama kungah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ziehin Eli innkuon’ khielna biehpiehna tawh ahi a, silpieh tawh ahi zongin khang tawntungin mai nawn lo ding hi, ci-in Eli’ innkuon tungah ka kiciem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingmawng dong tua tahah Samuel lum hi; tua ciengin ama in Topa’ inn kotkhahte a hong hi. Samuel in Eli kungah a mangmuna a gen ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle Eli in Samuel hlanin ama kungah, “Samuel, ka tapa aw,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Tanah om ing” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eli in, “Ama in na kunga ang gen bang ahiei? Kei kungah ei im malmal sin. Na kunga ang gen zosie ka kungah ip nang nei leh Pasien in nang hing dop bawl sih taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samuel in bangma ip nei loin a unpi-in a gen sieng hi. Tua ciengin Eli in, “Ama Topa hizuh a; ama in hoi a sah bangin kibawl taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel khanglien a, Topa in ama ompi-in a thugente khat zong tuolah kiesah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel zosie in Samuel pen a muontah Topa’ kamsang khat a hina thu Israel-te zosie in Dan panin Beer-sheba dongin a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Shiloh ah Topa’ kilah peisuoh hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ kammal tungtawnin Shiloh ah Samuel kungah Topa amama kilah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale Israel mi zosie tungah Samuel’ kammal a tung hi. Khum hun lai-in Israel-te do dingin Philistia-te a kikhawm vua, Israel-te zong amate do dingin kuon uhi; amate in Ebenezar ah giephuol satin Philistia-te in Aphek ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te do dingin Philistia-te a kiguol dimdem vua, amate a kido uleh Philistia-te in Israel-te zo-in galphuol sungah mi tulli kim bang that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Giephuol sungah galkapte a pei ciengun Israel upate in, “Tuni-in Topa in Philistia-te mai-ah bang dinga gal ei lelsah adiei? Eite lahah ama hing pei-in i galte’ khut sung panin ei hutdam thei nadingin Shiloh panin tam tahah Topa’ thuciemna singkuong puo vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite in Shiloh ah mi sawlin khumtah panin Cherub-te tunga to Vanglien Topa’ thuciemna singkuong a puo uhi. Khum tahah Pasien’ thuciemna singkuong tawh Eli’ tapa tegel Hophni le Phinehas a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ thuciemna singkuong giephuol sung a tun ciengin Israel zosie nahpi-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistia-te in kikona awging a zah ciengun amate in, “Hebrew-te’ giephuolah tam bang kikona awging vapuoh bang deina adiei?” a ci uhi. Giephuolah Topa’ singkuong tung zo ta hi ci thu a thei ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Giephuol sungah amau’ pasien-te tung zo hi,” a ci ziehun Philistia-te a zau uhi. Amate in, “Gim nga i hi ta uhi! Azieh pen nidangin tam bang pieng ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gim nga i hi ta uhi! Koi in tami a thahat pasien-te’ khut sung panin ei hunkhie zo ding ahei? Tamte khu gimna a tuomtuomte tawh gamlahah Egypt-te a thatgam pasien-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Philistia-te aw, amate noma’ sila a suo ngai bangun Hebrew-te’ sila na suo lo nadingun hang unlen, kipasalsah un; kipasalsah unlen do un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Philistia-te in a do uhi; Israel-te in gal lelin a inn ciet vuah a unpi-un a tai sieng uhi. Mi tampitah kithat hi, azieh pen Israel keng gakap mi tul sawmthum a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien’ singkuong kiman hi; tuale Eli’ tapa tegel Hophni le Phinehas zong si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin mi khat galphuol panin tai-in a puon ehkehsa le a lutunga leivui bangsa-in tuami ni ma-in Shiloh ah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama a tun ciengin Eli in Pasien’ singkuong lunghimawpi ahi ziehin lampi gei-a ama’ tona tungah to-in na khuodahdah hi. Khuopi sungah tua mipa pei-in a thu teng a gen ciengin khuopi sunga mi zosie a awng pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eli in tua kikona a zah ciengin, “Tami gamlumna bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Tua ciengin tua mipa naw pei-in Eli kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Eli kum sawmkuo le kum giet pha a, a mit mangin khuo mu thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mipa in Eli kungah, “Keima, galphuol pana ang pei ka hi hi; tuni-in galphuol panin kang tai hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ka tapa bang a ciei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamtaipa in dawngin, “Philistia-te mai-ah Israel-te a taimang zo ta vua, galkapte lahah a kithat mi tampi om hi. Na tapa tegel Hophni le Phinehas si zo hi, Pasien’ singkuong zong galte in ei matpieh ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in Pasien’ singkuong a genkhah laitahin tunkot gei ama’ tona panin Eli thalpua-in a ngawng tawngin a si hi, azieh pen ama tehsie ahi ta a, a pumpi a gih hi. Ama in Israel-te kum sawmli sung thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in a monu Phinehas’ zi gai-in a suoh kuon ahi hi. Ama in Pasien’ singkuong a kimatna, le a innpipa le a pasal sina thu a zah ciengin kunin nau a suoh hi; azieh pen ama takeih natna in tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama a si dihtah bepin ama a kem naudom numeite in, “Zau sin, azieh pen tapa khat na nei hi,” a ci uhi. Hizongle ama in dawnglo-in zong thudon lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in, “Minthanna in Israel taisan zo hi,” a cinopna-in nausen’ min Ichabod phuoh hi, azieh pen Pasien’ singkuong a kimat zo zieh le a innpipa le a pasal zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Pasien’ singkuong kiman zo ahi ziehin minthanna in Israel taisan zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistia-te in Pasien’ singkuong a mat zaw ciengun, Ebenezar panin Ashdod ah a tut uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua zaw ciengin Philistia-te in Dagon inn sungah Pasien’ singkuong puo-in Dagon gei-ah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing ciengin Ashdod-te a thobai vua, tuale Topa’ singkuong mai lei lahah mai kunin Dagon na pua hi. Tuaci’n amate in Dagon a la vua, a opna ngai-ah a koikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle a zing cieng zingmawngin a thobai vua, Topa’ singkuong mai lei lahah mai kunin Dagon na pua leuleu a, Dagon lutang le a khut tegel kisattanin sangkil tungah na om hi; Dagon pen a pumpi beh na omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua thu ziehin Dagon siempute le Ashdod-a Dagon inn-a lutte in tuni dongin Dagon sangkil tung a sia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod-te tungah Topa’ khut gih a, ama in uilut tawh Ashdod-te sung le a gam sung gawtin a zausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ashdod-te in sil omdan teng a mu bepun, “Eite tawh Israel-te Pasien’ singkuong om thei poma lo ding hi; azieh pen ama in eite le i Pasien Dagon ei genthei bawl hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi sawlin Philistia ulien zosie a khawmtuo vua, “Israel-te Pasien’ singkuong bang i law diei?” a ci uhi. Gath-a tengte in a dawng vua, “Ko kungah Pasien’ singkuong koisah vai,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n Gath ah Israel-te Pasien’ singkuong a tuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle amate in Gath ah a tut zaw ciengun Topa in tua khuopi langpanin zauna tampi piengsah hi; ama in a khuopi mite a teh a khangin gimsahin uilut a veisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ekron ah Israel-te’ Pasien’ singkuong a puoh uhi. Hinanle Ekron ah Pasien’ singkuong a tun ciengin Ekron khuo mite a kiko vua, “Bang dingin eite le i mite that dingin Israel Pasien’ singkuong i kung vua ang tut uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate in mi sawlin Philistia uliente zosie a khawm vua, “Ko le ka mite a tha lo nadingin Israel-te Pasien’ singkuong puodawh ta unlen, a opna ngai-ah peisahkia ta un,” a ci uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile a khuopi sung mun zosie-ah sina cing patauna a om hi. Pasien in khum munah amate a genthei bawl mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a silo sunteng zong uilut a vei vua, tuaci’n khuopi sungah kaa le mau vantung dongah a kato hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Philistia-te gam sungah Topa’ singkuong hla sagi sung a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Philistia-te in siempute le aisante hlanin, “ Topa’ singkuong bang i law diei? Ama opna munah bang tawh peisah ding i hei ei gen un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in, “Israel-te’ singkuong na sawldawh ding uleh a guohin sawl sih un, bangbang hile khielna zieha biehna pie un. Tua ciengin na dam ding vua, bang zieha note kung pana a khut a khin nai lo lam na thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, “Khielna zieha ama tunga i pieh ding biehna khu bang ahiei?” a ci uhi. Amate in a dawng vua, “Philistia uliente phaza tawh kituohin kham uilut nga le kham simbeng nga hi ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile no tung le na uliente uh tungah a kibang gimna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n na gam sung uh ang susie na uilut limte ule na simbeng limte uh bawlin, Israel-te’ Pasien tungah minthanna na pie ding uhi; ama in note le na pasien-te ule na gam tung vuah a khut ang zangsah thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt-te le Pharaoh in a lungsim uh a khausah bangin bang dingin na lungsim uh khausah ding na hi uh ahei? Ama in amate a ki-apmaipi zaw ciengin, amate in peisah a, tuaci’n amate peikhie uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin tu-in leeng tha khat le kol kivaw nai lo bawngpi no nei ni a baisa-in koi unlen, leengah tua bawngte vaw un. Ahi vangin a kung panun a note kai unlen inn ah peipi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ singkuong la-in leeng tungah koi unlen, khielna zieha biehna na pieh uh kham limte a singkuong khat sungah guongin a gei-ah koi un. Tua ciengin sawldawh unlen, a peina dingah peisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale en khinkhien un; bawngte in a gam zuonin Beth-shemesh lamah a peito leh, sietna golpi a tungsah pa ama hi ding hi; ahi vangin a peito sih leh ei gawtpa ama ahi sih hi; eite tunga a pieng mawhmawh hi, ci-in i thei ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mite in tua bang ma-in a bawl uhi; a no nei bawngpi ni kai-in bawng leengah a vaw vua, inn ah a note a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ singkuong pen kham simbeng le a uilut limte uh opna singkuong tawh leeng tungah a koiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamlien dung zui-in Beth-shemesh lam muhin bawngte tangtahin a pei vua, a pei kawmun a hamham uhi; zietlam hile veilam hile a kihei sih vua, tuale Philistia uliente in Bethshemesh ’ gamgi dongin a nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in Beth-shemesh mite in kuom sungah mangbu a at laitah uh ahi hi. Amate khuodahin singkuong a mu ciengun a en dingin kipahtahin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth-shemesh mi Joshua lo-ah a leeng tung a, khum tahah a khawl hi. Khum tahah suongtum golpi khat a om hi; tuacin a leeng singte phelkehin Topa tungah meihal biehna-in a bawngpite a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi-te in Topa’ singkuong le a panga kham milim opna singkuong la-in suongtumpi tungah a koi uhi. Tua ciengin Beth-shemesh mite in Topa tungah meihal biehnate le biehpiehnate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Philistia ulien ngate in tua teng a mu bepun khum ni ma-in Ekron-ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Philistia-te in khielna zieha biehna dinga Topa tunga a pieh uh kham uilutte: Ashdod ading khat, Gaza ading khat, Ashkelon ading khat, Gath ading khat, Ekron ading khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ulien ngate’ uh Philistia-te khuopi kulpi nei le khuoneu kul nei lote adingin a khuo phaza utawh kizui-in kham simbengte tawh zong ahi hi. Amate in Topa’ singkuong a koina gei vua suongtumpi pen Beth-shemesh mi Joshua’ lo-ah tuni dongin teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa’ singkuong a muoh ciengun Jeconiah’ suonlehlahte, Beth-shemesh mite tawh a lungdam ton sih uhi; tuale ama in amate sawm sagi that hi. Topa in mite lahah mi tampitah a tha tah ziehin mite da-in a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Beth-shemesh mite in, “Tam a siengtho Pasien, Topa mai-ah koi om zo ding ahei? I kung panun hemdawhin koi kungah i peisah diei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Kiriath-earim a tengte kungah patong sawlin, “Philistia-te in singkuong ei puohkia zo ta uhi. Hing peisuh unlen na kung vuah puoto un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuale Kiriath-jearim mite pei-in Topa’ singkuong a puoto vua, muol tunga Abinadab’ inn sungah a tut uhi. Amate in Topa’ singkuong kem dingin a tapa Eleazar a siensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim ah singkuong a om ni-a kipanin hun saupi sung, kum sawmni kim bang, Israel innkuon zosie in Topa ngai-in a thum vangut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in Israel innkuon zosie kungah, “Na lungsim zosie utawh Topa lamah a kiheikia na hi uleh, gamdang pasien-te le note lah panin Astartes-te paimang un. Na lungtang uh Topa lam ngatin ama’ na beh sem un, tua hile ama in Philistia-te’ khut sung panin ang hunkhie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel mite in Baal-te le Astartes-te a paimang vua, Topa’ na beh a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in, “Mizpah-ah Israel zosie a unpi-in khawm unlen, note dingin Topa tungah thu ka ngen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Mizpah ah a kikhawm vua, tui sawhin Topa mai-ah a sung uhi. Khum ni-in an a tang vua tuami munah, “ Topa mai-ah i khiel ta uhi,” a ci uhi. Tuale Samuel in Mizpah ah Israel mite thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mizpah ah Israel mite kikhawm zo hi, ci thu Philistia-te in a zah ciengun Israel do dingin Philistia uliente a kuonto uhi. Israel mite in tua thu a zah ciengun amate in Philistia-te a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite in Samuel kungah, “ Topa i Pasien in Philistia-te’ khut sung panin ei hunkhiet thei nadingin ama tungah thunget khawl vawt sin,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samuel in nawi ne lai tuuno khat la-in Topa tungah meihal biehna-in a buppi-in a pie hi; Topa tungah Israel adingin Samuel kiko a, tuale Topa in ama a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in meihal biehna a pieh laitahin Philistia-te in Israel do dingin a nai uhi; ahi vangin tua ni-in vanto tawh a kibang awging tawh Topa in Philistia-te do-in a amkhamsah gawp hi; tuale Israel mai-ah amate kinotmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mizpah panin Israel mite peikhie-in Philistia-te a nuadel vua, Beth-car galkhat cieng dongin a vatmai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in suong khat la-in Mizpah le Jeshanah kikalah phut a, a min Ebenezer phuoh hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama in, “ Topa in tu cieng dong ei panpi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Philistia-te kizo a, Israel gam sungah a lutkia nawn sih uhi; Samuel hun sung zosie Topa’ khut in Philistia-te a langpang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Philistia-te in Israel tung pana a lahsa uh khuopite, Ekron pan Gadth dong kikal sung teng, Israel tungah kipiekia hi; tuale Philistia-te’ khut sung panin Israel in a gam uh a ngakia hi. Israel le Amor-te kikalah zong kilemna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel in a hin sung tungtawnin Israel tungah thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kumkumin Bethel, Gilgal, le Mizpah ah zin kawikawi hi; tuale ama in tam munte zosie-ah Israel mite thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum munah a inn a op ziehin Ramah ah a pei zel hi; ama in khum muna Israel tungah zong a dihin thu khen a, Topa adingin maitam khat zong khum munah a lam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel a vuoi bepin ama in Israel tungah a tapate thukhenin koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tapa tapen Joel ahi a, a nina pen Abijah ahi hi; ama gel pen Beer-sheba a thukhente ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle a tapate in ama’ tawn dante zui loin, sum lamah a kihei vua, guhgol la-in, thutang a lehei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel upa zosie kikhawmin Ramah-a Samuel kungah a pei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale ama kungah, “Nang na vuoikawn ta a, na tapate in lah na tawndante a zui sih uhi; tua ciengin mi namdangte ma bangin kote ei uh ding kumpi khat ei guon in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Kote ei uh ding kumpi khat ei pie in,” a ci ciengun tam thu in Samuel lungkimsah lo hi. Samuel in Topa kungah thu ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in Samuel kungah, “Mite in na kunga ang gen uh thu zosie mang in; azieh pen nang ang nuol ahi sih a, amate tunga kumpi sem dingin kei ei nuol uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt pan amate ka peipi ni-a kipan tuni dongin kei ei nuasie-in pasien dangte’ na a sem vua, kei tunga ei bawl bangun nang tunga zong ang bawl uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin tu-in a thugen uh ngai in; amate lipkhaptahin na hilkhol beh ding hi. Amate tunga a uh ding kumpipa’ sepzie ding teng lah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samuel in ama kunga kumpi a ngen mite kungah Topa’ thugen zosie a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Note tunga ang uh ding kumpipa’ gamtatzie ding teng tam bang ahi hi: Ama in na tapate uh la-in leengte-ah nasemin a sakol nasem ding, a leengte mai-ah a tai dingin se ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale ama adingin a tulkhat uhte, le a sawmnga uhte, pawl khatte a lo kai-in a an at ding, le a gal vanzah le a leeng vanzahte bawl dingin se ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in panamtui bawl ding, an huon ding, le moh em dingin na tanute uh a la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in na lo te uh, na lengga lote uh, na olive lote uh lah panin a hoipen teng la-in a nasemte a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in na an le na lenggate uh’ sesawm-suo-sekhat la-in a uliente le a nasemte a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in na nasem pasalte, na nasem numeite, na bawnghonte, na laate lah panun a hoi pente la-in ama’ na sem dingin koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in na tuuhonte uh sawm-a- khat la ding a, ama’ sila na hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni-in noma dinga na teelsa uh na kumpipa uh ziehin na kap ding uhi; hizongle khum ni ciengin Topa in ang dawng sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin mite in Samuel’ thugen a mang sih uhi; amate in, “Hi lo e! Ka tung vua ei uh ding kumpi khat nei ding pen ka khensatsa uh ahi bo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaci’n kote zong minam dangte ma bangin ka kumpipa un ka tung vuah thu ang vaihawm ding a, ka mai vuah hing pei-in ka galte uh ei do pieh ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mite’ thugen zosie Samuel in a zah zaw ciengin ama in Topa’ bilkawm-ah tua teng a gensawnkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Samuel kungah, “A thugen uh mang inlen amate tungah kumpi khat koi in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Samuel in Israel mite kungah, “Mi zosie na inn ciet vuah pei ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin-te sung panin Aphiah’ tapa Bekorath, a tapa Zeror, a tapa Abiel, a tapa Kish a kici Benjamin-te mihau khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Saul kici tapa khat nei a, tangval meihoi khat ahi hi. Israel mite lahah ama sanga a melhoizaw koima om lo hi; midang zosie ama’ liengko cieng beh a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Saul’ pa Kish’ laate a mang hi. Tuaci’n Kish in a tapa Saul kungah, “Naupang khat zawpi inlen, laate va sui ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ephraim muoltung gam teng le Shalishah gam teng zawtin a sui vua, ahi vangin a mu sih uhi. Shaalim gam teng a nawh vangun khum gamah a om sih hi. Tua ciengin Benjamin gam teng a nawh vangun zong a mu tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuph gamah a tun ciengun Saul in a zawpi naupangpa kungah, “Kia ta vai. Tua hi sihle ka pa in laate lunghimaw nawn loin ei gel ei lunghimawpi ta zaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle ama in, “Tami khuo sungah Pasien’ mi khat om a, ama pen a kizatah mi khat ahi hi; a gen popo a manin tung hi. Tu-in khumnah va pei ta vai; ama in i khuolzinna thu ei genthei kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in naupangpa kungah, “Ahi mawh vangin pei leih tua mipa bang i tut diei? Azieh pen i ip sunga i mohte lah tawp zo ta a, Pasien’ mipa kunga i tawi ding letsong a om sih hi. Ei gel in bang i nei ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Naupangpa in Saul dawngkia-in, “Tamnah ngun shekel seli-suo-sekhat ka nei hi. I lampi ang gen nadingin ama ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(Nidang lai-in Israel sungah mi khat in Pasien kungah thu dong dingin a pei ciengin, “Hing pei in, thumu pa kungah va pei ta vai,” ci hi; azieh pen tulai taha kamsang i cite pen nidang lai-in thumu pa kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul in naupangpa kungah, “Hoi hi; hing pei inlen va pei ta vai,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Pasien’ mipa opna khuopi-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuopi lam zuonin muol tungah a peito laitahun tui tawi dinga a kuon ngahnu pawlkhat tawh a kituoh vua, amate kungah, “Thumu pa tanah a om ei mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, “Om ma, na mai diem vua pei ahi hi. Kinaw un; khuopi sungah tu mama-in ama pei zo hi, azieh pen tuni-in biehbuhno-ah mite in kithoina a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuopi sung na lut behun biehbuhno-ah an ne dinga a peito masangin ama na mu ding uhi. Biehpiehna thupha pie ding ahi ziehin ama pei masangin mite in an a ne sih ding uhi. Tua zaw ciengin a kihlante in ne thei pan beh uhi. Tu-in peito un, bang ding ahei cile ama na tuoh pailien ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate khuopi-ah a peito uhi. Khuopi sungah amate a lut laitahun biehbuhno lam zuona ang peito Samuel a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul a pei masang a zani-in Topa in Samuel kungah thu na gen zo ta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Zing cieng tu bang hunin na kungah Benjamin gam panin mi khat kang sawl ding a, ka mi Israel tunga a uh dingin ama sathau na nu ding hi. Ama in Philistia-te’ khut sung panin ka mite a hunkhie ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile a kikona uh ka kungah hing tung zo ahi ziehin ka mite’ thuohna ka mu zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Saul a mu ciengin, Topa in ama kungah, “Na kunga kang gen mipa tanah a om hi. Ka mite’ tunga a uh ding pa khu ama ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in tunkot sung lamah Samuel nai-in ama in, “Kang thum hi, thumu pa’ inn hei sung ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel in Saul dawngin, “Keima, thumu pa ka hi hi; ka masanga biehbuhno-ah peito in, azieh pen tuni-in kei tawh an na ne ding a, zingmawng ciengin nang hing peisahin, na lungsima om zosie kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tawpsa ni thum lai-a a mang na laate uh ahile kimu zo ta ahi ziehin ngaisutin nei nawn vet sin. Nang tung le na pupa innkuon sung zosie tungah Israel mi zosiete’ lungtup a op sih leh koi pen tungah om tava na ci ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Kei pen Israel minamte sung pan a citawm pen Benjamin-te ka hi a, keima’ innkuon zong Benjamin minam sunga innkuon zosiete sung pan a ginalo pen ka hi bo uhi. Tua ahile bang dinga tam banga nei hopi ahei?” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in Saul le a nasem naupangpa hlanin innkhan sungah zawpi a, mi sawmthum bang a pha a kihlan mite lahah tona thupi pen-ah ama a tosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Samuel in anhuon pa kungah, “Na tuom koi in ci-a kang pieh tanh pen hing la vawi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anhuon pa in samal le tua tawh a om teng la-in Saul mai-ah a lui hi. Samuel in, “En in, nang adinga kang tuomhenpieh teng na mai-ah kilui hi. Ne in; bang ding ahei cile a kise hun ciengin lenglate tawh na neh thei dinga na mai-a kikoi ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n khumi ni-in Samuel in Saul tawh an a ne ton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biehbuhno panin khuopi sungah amate a peisuh ciengun innkhum zangah Saul adingin lupna khat na kipha a, ama a kimu dingin a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zingmawng khuo va zaw ciengin Samuel in innkhum zanga Saul hlanin, “Na pei nading munah kang sawl thei nadingin tho in,” a ci hi. Saul zong tho-in khuopi gawlzin lamah ama le Samuel a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuopi gei lamah a peisuh laitahun Samuel in Saul kungah, “Tua naupangpa i mai-ah a peisuoh nadingin gen inlen, ama a peisuoh zaw ciengin nangma tungah Pasien’ kammal kang theisah thei nadingin tanah bakhat sung khawl phot in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in sathau thawl khat la a, a lu tungah buohin ama nam hi; ama in, “ Topa in ama’ mi Israel-te tunga uhpa dingin nang sathau ang nu zo hi. Topa’ mite tungah uhpa na hi ding a, a kimvel vua om a galte uh khut sung panin amate na hunkhie ding hi. Tu-in Topa in ama’ gouluote tungah uhpa dinga sathau ang nu zo a hina lim tam bang hi ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuni-in kei kung panin na pei ciengin Benjamin-te gam Rachel’ han gei-a Zelzah ah mi ni tawh na kituoh ding hi; ama gel in na kungah, ‘Na sui sui uh laate kimu zo a, tu-in ahile na pa in tuate lunghimawpi nawn loin nang ang lunghimawpi zaw ta a, “Ka tapa bang ka law ta diei?” a ci hi,’ ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum mun panin na pei lai ding a, Tabor-a gangpi lahah na tung ding hi; tua munnah Bethel-a Pasien kung a peito, kelno thum a kai mi khat, anlum thum a puo adang khat, le savun tuithawl dimtah lengga tui a puo mi khat, mi thum in nang ang dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in nang hing muohin anlum ni ang pie ding vua, tua khu amate tung pana na san ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Philistia khuocingte opna mun Gibeath-elohim na tung ding hi; tua khuopi sung na tun ciengin a mai vuah harp, tawm, theile, le lyre lasahna tawh lamin awngin biehbuhno pana ang kumsuh kamsang honkhat tawh na kituoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ hlagau in nang hing manin amate tawh lamin awngin kam na sang ding a, mi tuomdang khatin na kikhel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in tam limte na tuo khah ciengin sep dinga hoi na sah popo sem in. Azieh pen Pasien in nang ang ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ka masanga Gigal ah na peisuh ding hi; tua ciengin meihal biehna le thunuom biehna pie dingin na kungah kang peisuh ding hi. Na kungah hing pei-in na bawl ding teng kang lah masang, ni sagi sung nei na ngah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuel nuasie dingin a kinua hei leh Pasien in ama tungah lungtang dang khat a pie hi; khum ni-in tam lim teng zosie a unpi-in a tangtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum mun panin Gibeah lam a pei laitahun kamsang honkhat in ama a na lamdot uhi. Tuale Pasien’ hlagau in ama man a, amate tawh lamin awngin kam a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama a thei ngai mi zosie in kamsangte tawh a kamsante a mu ciengun, khatlekhat a kiho vua, “Kish’ tapa tungah bang tung adiei? Saul zong kamsangte khat ahi ta amah?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khum muna om pasal khat in dawng a, “A pa uh koi ahi diei?” a ci hi. Tua ziehin, “Saul zong kamsangte khat ahi ta amah?” ci paunah khat a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama lamin awngin kam a san zaw ciengin inn ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul’ pano in ama le naupangpa kungah, “Hei sunga va pei na hi vuoi?” a ci hi. Ama in dawngin, “Laate sui ka hi uhi; kimu zo nawn sih va ci-a ka thei bepun Samuel kungah ka va hawta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul’ pano in, “Samuel in na kunga ang gen teng kei kungah ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul in a pano kungah, “Ama in ka kung vuah laate kimu ta hi, ci-in ei gen hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Samuel’ gen a kumpi suo nading thu ama tungah bangma gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Mizpah-a Topa kungah mite khawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a kung vuah, “Israel-te’ Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: ‘Egypt panin Israel-te ka peipi a, Egypt-te’ khut sung le note ang bawlsie kumpi gamte zosie’ khut sung panin kang hunkhie hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle na gentheina ule na cimawnate pan vua note ang hunkhie na Pasien uh tuni-in nuolin, ‘Hi sih! ko tungah kumpi khat koi in,’ na ci uhi. Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na minam zui ule na be uh zui-in Topa mai-ah kilah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in Israel minam zosie a nai-ah a zawpi a, aisanna tawh Benjamin minam kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Benjamin minamte a innkuon kuonin peipi a, aisanna tawh Matri innkuon kila hi. A tawpna-ah Matri innkuon a mi malin peipi a, aisanna tawh Kish’ tapa Saul kila hi. Hinanle ama a sui ciengun ama kimu zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in, “Tua mipa tam sungah ang pei amah?” ci-in Topa a dongkia uhi. Tuale Topa in, “En un, ama vanlom lahah kiphuol hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate tai-in khum panin ama a zawpi uhi. Ama’ mite lahah a din ciengin adangte zosie a liengko cieng beh a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel in mi zosie kungah, “ Topa in a teelsa mipa na mu vuoi mah? Mite zosie lahah ama tawh kibang koima om lo hi,” a ci hi. Tuale mi zosie in, “Kumpipa khansau taheh!” ci-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Samuel in kumpipa’ thuneina le a nasep dingte mite kungah gen hi; tuale amate in zong laibu khatah gielin, Topa mai-ah a koi uhi. Tua ciengin Samuel in a inn ciet vuah mite a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gibeah-a a inn ah Saul pei a, Pasien in a lungsim a khoikhah mi thahatte zong ama tawh zawhton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle kimanna a nei lo mi pawlkhat in, “Tam pa in ei bangci hut zo ding ahei?” a ci uhi. Amate in ama a simmaw vua, ama kungah letsong a tawi sih uhi. Hinanle ama a sip dide hi. Tu-in ahile Ammon-te’ kumpipa Nahash in Gad-te le Reuben-te nasie tahin a bawlsie hi. Ama in a zietlam mit ciet uh kheipieh a, Israel hun ding mi pie lo hi. Ammon-te’ kumpipa Nahash in Israel-te a zietlam mit a kheipieh lo Jordan kuom tengah koima a om sih hi. Ahi vangin Ammon-te’ kung panin pasal tul sagi a suohta vua, Jabesh-gilead ah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hla khat bang zaw ciengin Ammon mi Nahash peito-in Jabesh-gilead a imtawm hi; tuale Jabesh mi zosie in Nahash kungah, “Ko tawh thukimna hing bawl in. Na na kang sem ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ammon mi Nahash in amate kungah, “Tam thu hangin no tawh thukimna ka bawl ding hi. Keima in mi zosie’ mit zietlam kheipieh dawhin Israel zosie tungah simmawna ka omsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabesh upate in ama kungah, “Israel gam sung zosie-ah kamtai ka sawl thei nadingun khuo ngai hun ni sagi sung ei pie’n. Tua ciengin ko ei hun ding mi khat zong a op sih leh na khut sungah kang kipie ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul’ khuo Gibeah ah kamtaite a tun ciengun amate in mite zahin thu a gen uhi; tuale mi zosie nahpitahin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in bawngtangte nua zui-in lo panin Saul a pei hi; tuale Saul in, “Bang thu om a mite hici kaa ahi vuoi?” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Jabesh mite’ thute ama kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in tam thu teng a zah ciengin ama tungah Pasien’ hlagau khautahin tungin nahpitahin a sin a so hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in bawng lengkai kap khat la-in tuate go-in semnen a, kamtaite sawlin Israel gam mun zosie-ah hlah a, “Saul le Samuel nua zui-a kuon lo poma a bawngte tunga a kibawl bangin kibawl ding hi!” ci-in a gen hi. Tua ciengin mite tungah Topa giinna tung a, mihing khat bangin kithutuohin a kuonkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Bezek ah mite a kaikhop ciengin Israel-te tul zathum pha a, Judah panin tul sawmsagi pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in kamtai-a peite kungah, “Jabesh-gilead a tengte kungah gen un: ‘Zing sun ciengin hutkhietna na nga ding uhi,’ ci-un,” a ci hi. Kamtaite tungin Jabesh-a tengte kungah a gen ciengun amate a lungdam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jabesh-a tengte in Nahash kungah, “Zing ciengin na kungah kang kipie ding vua, hoi na sah bangin ka tung vuah nei bawl ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zing ciengin Saul in mite pawl thumin a khen hi. Giephuol sungah zingmawng tungin a pei vua, sun nisat dongin Ammon-te a satlia uhi; tuale mi ni nangawn omton thei lo ding za dongin a suohta sunte a kithezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite in Samuel kungah, ‘Saul in eite ei uh ding amah?’ a ci pen khu, “Koi na hi vuoi? Amate i tha thei nadingin ka kung vuah ei pie’n,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Saul in, “Tuni-in mi khat zong kithat lo ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tuni-in Topa in Israel tungah hutkhietna ei puoh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuel in mite kungah, “Hing pei un, Gilgal ah peito vai-in khum munah kumpi dingin Saul kipsah phakia vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gilgal ah mi zosie a pei vua, amate in tua mun Topa mai Gilgal ah kumpi-in Saul a koi uhi. Khum tahah amate in Topa mai-ah thunuom biehna a pie vua, khum tahah Saul le Israel-te zosie nahpitahin a kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Israel-te zosie kungah, “Ka kunga na thugen zosie uh ka ngai zo ta a, na tung vuah kumpi khat ka koi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En un, tu-in na makaipa uh kumpi ahi hi; kei vuoi-in ka sam kang zo a, hizongle ka tapate note tawh a om uhi. Ka neu lai-a kipan tuni tanpha-in note kang makai zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanah kei ka om hi; Topa mai le a sathau nu pa mai-ah ka mawna hing pulah un. Koi bawngtang ka lahpieh ahei? Ahi sihle koi laa ka lahpieh ahei? Ahi sihle koi ahei ka sol? Koi ahei ka bawlsiet? Ahi sihle ka mit tawt nadingin koi khut sung panin guhgol la ka hei? Ka langkhatah teci hing pang unlen, tua teng kang dinkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in a kungah, “Nang in kote nei sol sih a, zong nei bawlsie sih a, mi khat popo kung panin zong guhgol na la sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Ka khut sungah bangma na mu lona uh na langkhat vuah Topa teci ahi a, ama’ sathau nu pa zong tuni-in teci ahi hi,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Ama teci ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuel in mite kungah, “Moses le Aaron a na se, Egypt gam pan na pu na pate uh a na peipi Topa khu teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in note le na pu na pate adingin Topa’ hutdamna nasep zosie Topa mai note tungah hing pulahin kang mawsah thei nadingin na ding lai tadi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt gamah Jacob a pei ciengin Egypt-te in na bawlsie-in, tua ciengin Topa tungah na pu na pate a na kiko vua, ama in Egypt panin na pu na pate peipi-in tam munah amate a tengsah ahi Moses le Aaron, Topa in a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Topa a Pasien uh a mangngil uhi; tuale ama in Hazor kumpipa Jabin’ galkapmangpa Sisera’ tung, Philistia-te, tung le Moab kumpipa tungah amate zua a, tam mite in amate a sim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa kungah amate kiko-in, ‘Kohaw ka khiel ta uhi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa ka taisan ta vua, Baal-te le Ashtaroth-te’ na ka sem ta uhi; ahi vangin tu-in ka galte’ khut sung panin ei hunkhie in, na na ka sem ding uhi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in Jerubbaal, Barak, Jephthah le Samson sawlin na kim na pam zosie vua na galte uh’ khut sung panin note ang hunkhie hi; tuale lungmuongin na teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle note sim dingin Ammon kumpipa Nahash ang kuon na mu ciengun, Topa na Pasien uh pen na kumpi uh hi napi note in kei kungah, ‘Hi sih, kumpi khat ma in ei uh ding hi bo,’ na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En un, noma’ teelsa, noma’ ngetsa kumpipa tanah a om hi; en un, Topa in na tung vuah kumpi khat koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa zatahin a na semin a thu zong mangin, Topa’ thupieh na langpan sih vua, noma le ang uh kumpipa in na ni-un na Topa Pasien uh’ nua na zui uleh thu ang hoi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahi vangin note in Topa’ thu na man sih vua, Topa’ thupieh na langpan uleh Topa’ khut in note le na kumpipa uh ang langpan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in dai dide-in om unlen, na muna vuah Topa in ang bawl ding ahi tam na lienpi en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhun pen mangbu at laitah hi lo amah? Van ang tosah nading le guo ang zuhsah nadingin Topa kungah thu ka ngen ding hi; tuale noma adinga kumpi khat na ngetna ziehun Topa muna-ah na gitlo gamtatnate uh a lien mama ahi lam mu-in na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Samuel in Topa tungah thu ngen a, khum ni-in Topa in van tosahin guo zusah hi; tuale mi zosie in Topa le Samuel zatah citahin a zatah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi zosie in Samuel kungah, “Na nasemte ka si lo nadingun Topa na Pasien tungah thu ei ngetpieh in; azieh pen ka mawnate uh banah koma adingin kumpi khat ka nget ziehun sietna ka belap lailai uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuel in mite kungah, “Zau sih un; tam gitlona zosie na bawl zo ta uhi, hinanle Topa na zuina uh pan piel sih unlen na lungsim zosie utawh Topa’ na sem un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale hattuomna ei pie thei lo, ei hunkhie thei lo, kimanna a nei lo nate lamah piel sih un, azieh pen tuate in kimanna nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in ama’ min lienpi a khuolna-in a mite nolh lo ding hi. Azieh pen ama’ mi-a note ang bawl ding Topa’ deilam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua tham loin kei ka hi leh note adingin Topa kungah thungetpieh lona tawh ka na maw vawt sih ding hi; tuale keima in a hoi le a man lampi note kang hil ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa beh zatah unlen na lungsim zosie utawh citahin ama’ na sem un; azieh pen ama in note dinga ang bawlpiehsa na lienpite ngaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin sietna na bawl nah lai uleh, note le na kumpipa uh na ni-un ang kisumaimang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul kumpi a suo patin kum sawmthum pha a, ama in kum sawmni le kum ni sung Israel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in Israel sung panin mi tul thum teel hi; tul nite Michmash le Bethel muoltung gamah Saul tawh a om vua, tul khatte Benjamin gam Gibeah-ah Jonathan tawh a om ton uhi; ama in mi a omlai teng a puonbuh vuah peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan in Geba-a om Philistia khuocingte zo hi; tuale Philistia-te in tua thu a na za uhi. Tuale Saul in gam zosie-ah pengkul mut a, “Hebrew-zosie zasah un!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul in Philistia khuocingte a zawna le Philistia-te adingin Israel huothuoi a hina zong Israel in a zah ciengin, Gilgal ah Saul panpi dingin mite kihlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel tawh kido dingin Philistia-te a kikhawm vua, leeng tul sawmthum, sakol galkap tulguh, le a galkapte tuipi gei-a senel za-in a tam uhi; amate zong peito-in Beth-avan nisuona lam Michmasah ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistia-te in Israel nah neh mama uh ahi ziehin lungkham mangbahna sungah a op lam uh a kithei ciengun suonghawm sung, leihawm sung, suong kawhawm lah, han lah le tuikhuh sung lah po-ah a kiphuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hebrew mi pawlkhat in Jordan gun kantanin Gad le Gilead gamah a galkai uhi. Gilgal ah Saul om lai a, mi zosie in a citun sa-in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Samuel’ hun ciengtan ahi ni sagi sung a ngah hi; ahi vangin Gilgal ah Samuel pei nawn loin Saul kung panin mite a taimang sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in, “Kei kungah meihal biehna le thunuom biehnate hing tawi un,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in meihal biehna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in meihal biehna a man lien ciengin Samuel a tung hi; tuale ama a dawn ding le a muoh dingin Saul a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel in, “Bang bawl na hiei?” a ci hi. Saul in dawngkia a, “Kei kung panin mite a taimang vua, a ni ciengtan hun sungin nang lah nang tung sih a, Michmash-ah Philistia-te a kikhop uh ka mu ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />keima in, ‘Tu-in Gilgal ah keima ei do dinga ang kumsuh ding uh ahi ta a, ken lah Topa maipha ka ngen nai sih hi,’ ka ci hi; tuaci’n kei mama in meihal biehna ka na paupieh ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kungah, “Nang na mot gamtat ta hi; nang in thu ang pie Topa na Pasien’ thupieh na zui ta sih hi. Topa in Israel tungah na kumpi gam kipsah zing ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin tu-in na kumpi gam kizomsuoh lo ding a, Topa in ama’ lunglamsu mi khat a sui zo hi. Topa ang thupieh na zui lo ziehin ama’ mite tungah a uh dingin Topa in ama a se zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel ding dawhin Gilgal panin Benjamin gam Gibeah ah peito a, a omlai mi teng in galkap lut dingin Saul nua zui uhi; Gilgal panin Bejamin gam Gibeah lam naw-in amate a peito uhi. Saul in ama tawh a omton mite sim a, pasal zaguh bang a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul, a tapa Jonathan, le a ompi mite Benjamin gam sung Gibeah ah a om uhi; ahi vangin Philistia-te in Michmash ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Philistia-te’ giephuol panin galguh pawl thumin a kuonkhie uhi; pawlkhat Shual gam Ophrah lamah kihei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />adang pawlkhat in Beth-horon lam manaw-in pawl khatte gamlah Zeboiim kuom a kimusuhna muoltung lamah a kihei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khum hunin Israel gam sung zosie-ah siakheng khat zong kimu lo hi; azieh pen Philistia-te in, “Hebrew-te in namsau hile teipi hile kheng thei lo ding hi,” a ci uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaci’n Philistia-te kungah amau’ bawng lohlawna tu, tuzum, hei, ahi sihle a phieukawi-te uh kheng dingin Israel-te a peisuh let uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />lohlawna tu le tuzum khenhiem man pen shekel sethum- suo-seni hi a, hei khenhiem man le ciengkhuta sia phu man shekel khat sethum-suo-sekhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n gal a kisim ni-in Saul le Jonathan tawh a omton mi khat popo’ khut sungah namsau hile teipi hile a om sih hi; hinanle Saul le a tapa Jonathan in tuate a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in Michmash peina ciengkotah Philistia khuopicingte a cing dingin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Saul’ tapa Jonathan in a galvan puo tangvalpa kungah, “Hing pei in, gal khat a Philistia khuocingte kungah va pei ta vai,” a ci hi. Hinanle ama in a pa kungah a pei ding lam gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migron-a om Gibeah nawla mang kawlsing kung nei-ah Saul a om hi; ama tawh galkap zaguh bang omton a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuate tawh Shiloh ah siempupuon a tawi Topa’ siempu Eli’ tapa Phinehas, a tapa Ichabod, a sanggampa Ahitub’ tapa Ahijah zong a om uhi. Mite in Jonathan a pitmang lam a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia khuocingte’ opna-a pei ding Jonathan in a na hanciemna ciengkot a pang khatah suongdawh khat om a, a pang lang khatah zong suongdawh khat ma a om hi; a khat min Bozez ahi a, a dangkhat min Seneh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suongdawh khat pen Michmash mai leilu lamah dawhin a khat pen Geba mai leitaw lamah a dawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan in a galvan puo tangvalpa kungah, “Hing pei in, a tep kitanlo dawibie mi tam khuocingte kungah va pei ta vai; Topa in ei adingin ei seppieh kha ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile hutdam nadingin a tam le a tawm in Topa khahtan zo lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A galvan puopa in ama kungah, “Na lungsim sunga na bawl nuom zosie bawl in. Nangma tawh kang omton hi; na ngaisut bang teng kei ngaisutna zong ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in, “Tu-in khum mite kungah va galkai ta vai-in, amate kungah va kila ta vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in i kung vuah, ‘Na kung vua kang pei masang ei na ngah un,’ a ci uleh i opna munah sip dide-in na ding vai-in, a kung vuah va peito da vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle amate in, ‘Kohaw kungah hing peito ta un,’ ei ci uleh va peito vai; azieh pen Topa in i khut sungah amate ei pie zo hi. Tam khu eite dingin lim hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n a ni-un Philistia inncingte kungah pei-in a va kimusah ta uhi; tuale Philistia-te in, “En un, a kiphuolna uh leihawm panin Hebrew-te ang pusuoh ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuocing mite in Jonathan le a galvan puopa na muoh vua, “Ko kungah hing peito un; bang khat hing ensah va ung,” a ci uhi. Jonathan in a galvan puopa kungah, “Ka nua ei zuito-in; azieh pen Topa in Israel’ khut sungah amate a pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khut le a keng tawh Jonathan kato a, a galvan puopa in a zui hi. Jonathan in Philistia-te vatmai a, a galvan puopa in a nua-ah amate that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jonathan le a galvan puopa in mi a tha masah lai-un lo acre khat dung zui-in lokaina kuoh dung tawnlang sungah mi sawmni bang that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin giephuol sung, lozau sung, le mite lahah patauna a om hi; khuocingte le gal bulute nasan a citun uhi; Zil kiling hi; tua khu patauna lienpi khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin-te’ gam sunga Gibeah-a Saul’ galvilte in a et ciengun tam lam le khum lama a kikhin valuoi mite a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in a kunga om galkapte kungah, “Mi sim unlen i sungpanin koi peikhie ahei thei un,” a ci hi. Mi a sim zaw ciengun Jonathan le a galvan puopa na om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saul in Ahijah kungah, “Pasien’ singkuong tanah hing peipi in,” a ci hi. Azieh pen khum hun lai-in Pasien’ singkuong Israel-te tawh a zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul in siempu pa a hopi laitahin Philistia-te’ giephuol sungah buoina a khang tehteh hi; Saul in siempupa kungah, “Na khut ladawh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul le ama tawh a zawhton mi zosie kikhawmin galphuol lam zuonin a pei uhi; tuale kitawhnawina lienpi khat na om a, khatlekhat namsau tawh a kivat ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in Philistia-te tawh nidanglai-a na omtonsa le giephuola amate tawh na pei zosa Hebrew-te kihei-in Saul le Jonathan tawh a omton Israel-te lamah a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ma bangin Ephraim muoltung gama a kiphuoldap Israel-te zosie in Philistia-te galtai zo ta uhi, ci thu a zah ciengun amate in zong galphuolah a dap zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in khum ni-in Israel-te galzawna a ngasah hi. Beth-aven kal dongin galkidona om a, Saul tawh a omton galkapte a kigawmin tul sawm bang pha hi. Ephraim muoltung gam dongin galkidona kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul in khum ni-in mot gamtatna khat a bawl hi. Ama in galkapte tungah kiciemna khat na koi a, “Nitah masang le ka galte tungah phu ka lah zawh masangin an a ne poma samsiet nga taheh,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n galkapte koima in an a ciem sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuoiphang opna mun khatah galkap zosie a tung vua, tuatah leilahah khuoizu na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuoiphang opna munah galkapte a tun ciengun khuizu a na hlita dildel hi; ahi vangin amate in a kam sung vuah a khut uh a koi sih uhi. azieh pen amate in kiciemna a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle a pa in galkapte tungah kiciemna tawh a tomlaw lam Jonathan in a za kha sih hi; tuaci’n ama in khuoiphang sunga om ciengkhut diesuhin khuoizu a lieh leh a mit pelin a tha a hatkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapte lahah khat in, “Na pa in kiciemna tawh nasietahin galkapte na tomlaw a, ‘Tuni-a an ne mi koipo samsiet tang taheh,’ a ci hi. Tuale galkapte gilkielin a basam uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in, “Ka pa in gam sung a gentheisah hi; tam khuoizu themno khat ka ciep ziehin ka mit ang pelin ka tha ang hatkiana khu en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuni-in galkapte in a galvanlah-te uh a dudu-un ne uleh bangza tahin a hoizaw lai diei; bang ding ahei cile tu-in Philistia-te in mi tampi i that zo nai sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in khum ni-in Michmash panin Aijalon dong Philistia-te a satpua zaw ciengun galkapte a basam uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuaci’n galvan kinuasiete tungah galkapte bawhsuhin, lei lahah tuu le bawngtangte le bawngnote a go uhi; tuale a galkapte in tuate a si tawh a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul kungah thu kitut a, “En in, galkapte in a si tawh sa a neh ziehun Topa tungah a maw uhi,” kici hi. Tuale ama in, “Note na zuou gamtat ta uhi. Ka mai-a tam sungah suongtum golpi khat hing lia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Saul in, “Galkapte lahah no le no na kithezah unlen a kung vuah, ‘Mi zosie in a bawngtang uh hile a tuu uh hile tanah hing peipi-in gosah unlen, a sa ne uheh; a si pum a nehna tawh Topa tungah maw sih un,’ ci-un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n khum zanin galkapte zosie in a bawngtangte uh kai-in khum munah a go uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuale Saul in Topa adingin maitam khat a lam hi; tua khu ama in Topa dinga a bawl masah pen maitam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in, “Zanin Philistia-te va delsuh ta vai-in zing khuovah masangin va sugam ta vai; mi khat zong hen sih vai,” a ci hi. Amate in, “Hoi na sah bangin bawl in,” a ci uhi. Ahi vangin siempupa in, “Tanah Pasien dong masa tadi vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in Pasien dong a, “Philistia-te nuadela va peisuh ta ding ka mah? Israel’ khut sungah amate nei pie diei mah?” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Pasien in khum ni-in ama a dawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul in, “No mipi makaite aw, na unpi-un tanah hing pei un; tuni-in tam mawna bang hing ci pien ahei ci guizui vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Israel a hundam Topa a hin ma bangin, ka tapa Jonathan tung nangawnah tua mawna a om le zong ama si valon ding hi!” a ci hi. Ahi vangin mi zosie lahah ama a dawng koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in Israel zosie tungah, “Note langkhatah om unlen, kei le ka tapa Jonathan a langkhatah ka om ding uhi,” a ci hi. Mite in Saul kungah, “Hoi na sah bangin bawl in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua bepin Saul in, “Israel’ Pasien Topa aw, tuni-in bang dinga na nasempa nei dawn lo ahei? Tami khielna kei tungah ahi a, ka tapa Jonathan tungah ahi zongin a op leh “Israel’ Pasien Topa aw, ai a kisan ciengin Urim hing hisah in. Ahi vangin tam khielna na mi Israel tunga tu ahile ai a kisan ciengin Thummim hing hisah in,” a ci hi. Tua aisanna in Jonathan le Saul kawh a, ahi vangin mipite a peng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in, “Kei le ka tapa kikalah aisan un,” a ci hi. Tuale Jonathan kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in Jonathan kungah, “Bang ahiei na bawl ei gen vawi,” a ci hi. Jonathan in ama kungah, “Ka khut sunga ka tawi ciengkhut dawn tawh khuoizu themno khat ka ciem kha hi; tanah om ing, kei a si ding ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in, “Jonathan aw, nang na si sih tah leh Pasien in kei ei dop bawl sih taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tua ciengin mite in Saul kungah, “Israel sungah tam guolzawna lienpi a piengsah Jonathan si ding ahi amah? Si mawngmawng sih va! Topa a hing ahi ma bangin a lutunga a samzam khat zong tuolah a kie sih ding hi; azieh pen ama in tuni-in Pasien tawh kopin na a sem zo hi,” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n mite in Jonathan a tankhie vua, tuale ama a si nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in Philistia-te a nuadel khawl a, Philistia-te zong a mun ciet a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel tungah Saul kumpi a suo zaw ciengin muncin tenga a galte zosie, Moab-te, Ammon-te, Edom-te, Zobah kumpite, le Philistia-te a do hi; a kiheina popo-ah ama in gal a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama in hangtahin gal do a, Amalek-te vatpua-in amate a suom mite’ khut sung panin Israel a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tu-in Saul’ tapate Jonathan, Ishvi, le Malchishua ahi uhi; tuale a tanu nite: a uzaw’ min Merab ahi a, a naunu’ min Michal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Saul’ zinu min Ahinoam ahi a, Ahimaaz’ tanu ahi hi. A galkap mangpa’ min Abner ahi a, Saul’ pano Ner’ tapa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kish pen Saul’ pa ahi a, Abner’ pa Ner Abiel’ tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Saul a hin sung tungtawnin Philistia-te tawh kidona a om hi; tuale Saul in mi thahat khat popo ahi a, galhang khat popo ahi zongin a mu ciengin a galkap dingin a la hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kungah, “ Topa in ama’ mi Israel tungah kumpi dingin nang sathau nu dingin kei ei sawl hi; tua ahi ziehin tu-in Topa’ thugen ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi, ‘Egypt panin Israel-te a peito lai-un lam kalah Israel-te a langpan ziehun Amalek-te dan ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in kuonin Amalek-te va sim unlen, a neisa zosie uh va susiemang ta un; amate hinkhawi loin numei le pasal, nausen le nawitep laite, bawngtang le tuu, kalaoh le laa-te that sieng un,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in zong mi hlanin Telaim-ah mi phaza sim a, lei galkap mi tul zani le Judah mi tul sawm pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amalek khuopi-ah Saul pei a, kuom sungah a buhdap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Ken-te kungah, “Pei un! Dingdawh un! Amalek-te lah panin kihemkhie un, tua ahi sihle amate tawh kang susie ton ding hi; azieh pen Egypt panin a peito lai-un Israel mi zosie tungah migitna na lah uhi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Amalek-te lah panin Ken-te a kihemkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in Havilah panin Egypt gam nisuona lama om Shur dongin Amalek-te a zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Amalek-te’ kumpipa Agag hingmat a, ahi vangin namsau tawh mi zosie that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul le mite in Agag, le tuu le bawng a hoi pente, bawngno le tuuno a thaute, le van manpha zosie hinkhawi-in a susie sih uhi; amate in a kithuse lo le bangma man lo zosie teng a susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kumpi-a Saul ka koikhah ka kisia hi, azieh pen keima ei zuina panin kinua hei-in ka thupiehte sem lo hi,” a ci hi. Samuel lungthah a, zan tungtawnin Topa tungah a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingmawngin Saul dawn dingin Samuel thobai a, tuale Samuel kungah, “Carmel-ah Saul pei-in tua munah ama dingin phawna muol suong khat phut a, a kilekia ciengin Gilgal-ah a peisuoh hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul kungah Samuel a pei ciengin Saul in ama kungah, “ Topa in nang thupha hing pie taheh; keima in Topa’ thupiehna ka sem zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Samuel in, “Tua ahile ka bila ka zah tuu hamte le bawng hamte bang ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in, “Tuate Amalek-te kung pana ang peipi uh ahi hi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa na Pasien tungah biehpiehna dingin mite in a tuituoh pen tuute le bawngte a hen uhi; hizongle adang teng ka that sieng ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in Saul kungah, “Khawl vawi! Tuzanin ka Topa in ka kunga ei thugen pen nang kungah hing gen vang,” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Hing gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in, “Nangma mi neuno khatin na kingaisut vangin Israel minamte’ lutang na hi sih amah? Topa in Israel tungah kumpi dingin sathau ang nu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale Topa in na sem dingin nangma ang sawl a, ‘Pei in; mawnei Amalek-te va thatgam sieng inlen, a si sieng dongun va sim tan,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale bang dinga Topa’ thu mang lo na hei? Bang dingin van kinuasiete zamin Topa’ mitmu-in a sie gamta na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul in Samuel kungah, “ Topa’ thu ka mang zo a, Topa in ka sep dinga ei sawl nasepna-ah ka pei zo hi. Amalek-te’ kumpipa Agag kang peipi zo a, Amalek-te zong ka sumang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin mite in gal vanlahte, tuute le bawngte, suhsiet dinga ki-ap sil hoi pente, Gilgal-a Topa tungah biehpiehna dingin a la uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuale Samuel in, “ Topa in meihal biehnate le biehpiehnate, Topa thu man ding za-in dei luo ahi amah? Biehpiehna sangin thu man ding hoizaw tahtah a, tuutang thaute sangin thu ngai ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ledona pen aisan mawna sangin neuzaw tuon lo a, lungkhauhna zong khielna le milim biehna ma tawh kibang ahi hi. Nang in Topa’ thu niel zo na hi ziehin, ama’n zong kumpi hina panin ang nuol ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul in Samuel kungah, “Kei ka khiel zo hi; bangzieh ahei cile mite giingin a thu uh ka man khah ziehin Topa’ thupiehna le nangma’ thute ka palsat zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in kang thum hi, ka khielna ei ngaidam inlen, Topa ka bieh thei nadingin ei zuikia ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Samuel in Saul kungah, “Kang zuikia sih ding hi; azieh pen nangma in Topa’ thu na niel zo ta a, Topa in Israel tunga kumpi na hina panin ang nuol zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pei dingin Samuel a kihei ciengin Saul in a puontuolpi mongah a nua mat leh a puon a ehkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel in ama kungah, “Tuni ma ma-in Topa in nang kung panin Israel’ kumpi gam botkehin nang sanga a hoizaw na vengpa tungah a pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua banah Israel’ Minthanna Pa in a thu dawhkia lo ding a, a lungsim zong a khel sih ding hi. Azieh pen a lungsim khel dingin ama mihing hi lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in, “Kei ka maw zo ta hi; hinanle tu-in ka mi upate mai le Israel mai-ah ei patawi inlen, Topa na Pasien ka bieh thei nadingin kei ei zuikia ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul’ nua zui-in Samuel a kilekia hi; tuale Saul in Topa a bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in, “Amalek kumpipa tam sung keima kungah hing peipi in,” a ci hi. Tuale a citunsa-in ama kungah Agag a pei hi. Agag in, “Tam pen sisie-a sina tahtah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Samuel in, “Na namsau in nute ta nei lo-a a koi bangin, na nu zong numeite lahah ta nei loin a om ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Samuel in Gilgal-a Topa mai-ah Agag a tuntan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ramah ah Samuel a pei hi; tuale Gibeah-a ama’ inn ah Saul a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Samuel in a si dongin Saul mu nawn lo hi, ahi vangin Saul tungtangah Samuel da mama hi. Tuale Topa in Israel tungah kumpi dingin Saul a koi khah a kisia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Samuel kungah, “Saul ziehin bang tanvei da ding na hei? Israel tungah kumpi dingin ama ka nuol zo ta hi. Na sathau bung sungah sathau a dimin thal inlen dingdawh in; keima in Bethlehem-a Jessi kungah kang sawl ding hi, azieh pen a tate lah panin keima dingin kumpi khat ka koi zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Samuel in, “Bangci pei thei ding ka hei? Saul in za leh ama in kei ei that ding hi,” a ci hi. Topa in, “Bawnglaa khat kai inlen ama kungah, ‘ Topa tungah biehpiehna pie dinga ang pei ka hi hi,’ ci-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehpiehna-ah Jessi hlan inlen na bawl ding teng kang hil ding hi; tuale nangma in a min kang gen pa sathau nei nupieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh bangin Samuel gamta a, Bethlehem ah a ma a pei hi. Ama dawn dingin khuopi upate citun kawmin a pei vua, ama kungah, “Thuhoi-a hing kalsuon na hiei mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Thuhoi ahi hi; Topa kungah biehpiehna pie dinga ang pei ka hi hi; noma ciet kisiensuo unlen biehpiehna-ah kei tawh hing pei un,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in Jessi le a tapate siensuo-in biehpiehna-ah amate a hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a tun ciengun ama in Eliab en a, “Tu-in ahile Topa mai-ah Topa’ sathau nu pa om tahtah hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in Samuel kungah, “A melpuoh ahi sihle a duong sanna lam en sin, azieh pen keima in ama ka nuol zo hi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in mihingte’ mu bangin a mu sih hi; amate in a putham melpuoh dan en a, hinanle Topa in lungtang a en hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jessi in Abinadab hlanin Samuel mai-ah a peisah hi. Ama in, “ Topa in tampa zong teel lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Jessi in Shammah peisah leuleu hi. Tuale ama in, “ Topa in tampa zong teel lo hi,” ci leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jessi in Samuel mai-ah a tapa sagite a peisah a, tuale Samuel in Jessi kungah, “ Topa in tam mite khat zong teel lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel in Jessi kungah, “Na tapa zosie tana om sieng ma uh ahiei mah?” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “A nautum pen om lai hi, ahi vangin ama tuucinga om ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Samuel in Jessi kungah, “Mi sawl unlen ama hing zawpi ta un; azieh pen ama tam sunga ang tun masangsie i kipan thei sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in mi sawlin ama a tumpi hi. Ama cisan suo-in dam mel puo a, a mit ha dan kilawm a, a mel zong hoi hi. Topa in, “Ding inlen ama sathau nu in; tampa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in sathau bung la-in a sanggamte mitmu-in ama sathau a nu hi; tuale khum ni-a kipanin David tungah Topa’ hlagau khautahin a tung hi. Tua ciengin David dingdawh a, Ramah ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in Saul kung panin Topa’ hlagau a peidawh a, Topa kung panin hla gilo khat in ama a bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul’ nasemte in ama kungah, “Tu-in en in, Pasien kung panin hla gilo khat in nang ang bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I pu un tu-in ang kem na nasemte tungah lyre a tumsiem mi pawlkhat a sui nadingun thu pie in; na kungah Pasien’ kung pana ang pei hla gilo ang tun ciengin ama in tuami ang tum ding a, na ci ang dam ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in a nasemte kungah, “A tum siem mi khat ei suipieh unlen, ka kungah hing zawpi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tangvalte khat in dawng a, “Bethlehem-a Jessi’ tapa, tumging tum siem, galhang, galdo siem, thugen lama a pilvang, mi melpieng khat ka mu hi; tuale Topa in ama a ompi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in Jessi kungah kamtaite sawlin ama kungah, “Tuucinga om na tapa David ka kungah hing sawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jessi in laa khat kai-in anlum, lenggazu savun thawl khat, keelno khat puosahin Saul kungah a tapa David a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul kungah David tung a, tuaci’n ama na semin a pang hi. Saul in ama it mama a, a galvan puopa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jessi kungah Saul in mi sawlin, “Ka na semin David hing omsah ta’n, azieh pen ama in ka maipha a mu hi,” a cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul tungah Pasien kung pana hla gilo a tuh popo ciengin David in a lyre la-in a khut tawh tum a, tuaci’n Saul thathokia-in nuomtuom a, ama kung panin hla gilo a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Philistia-te in gal sim dingin a galkapte a khawm uhi; Judah gam Socoh ah amate kituo-in Socoh le Azekah kikal Ephes-dammim ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul le Israel-te zong kikhawmin Elah kuomah giephuol a sat vua, Philistia-te do dingin a kithawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A galkhat muol tungah Philistia-te dingin Israel zong a gal langkhat muol tungah a ding vua, a kikal vuah kuompi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia-te’ giephuol panin Gath khuomi Goliath a kici a makai, a tun tong guh le khap khat a sang mipa khat a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in sumngo sia lukhu khu-in sia songkhol tawh kivon hi; a sia songkhol sumngo shekel tulnga gih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a keng gelah sumngo ngaltuom bun a, a liengko-ah sumngo teikhaw khat kikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A teibul pen siem lawngpi tawh kibang a, a teimuh pen sia shekel zaguh gih hi; tuale ama mai-ah a lum tawipa a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama dingto-in Israel gal lamkaite awhsan a, “Bang zieha galsim dinga hing kuon na hi uh ahei? Kei Philistia mi khat ka hi a, no Saul’ nasemte hi lel lo uh na mah? No lah panin pasal khat hing teel unlen ka kungah hing peisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’n kei ei do-in ei tha zawh leh no sila kang suoh ding uhi; ahi vangin ken ama zo-in ka tha zawh leh ko sila nang suoh ding vua kote’ na na sem ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale Philistia-te in, “Tuni-in Israel gal lamkaite kang tawh hi! I kido thei nadingin mi khat ei pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul le Israel zosie in Philistia-pa’ thugen a zah uh ciengin lungkie-in nahpitahin a zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David pen Judah gam Bethlehem-a Ephrathah-te Jessi min nei pa’ tapa ahi a, ama in tapa sagi nei hi. Saul hun lai-in tua mipa vuoi-in kum tampi pha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jessi’ tapa a tapen thumte in galphuol-ah Saul a zui uhi; gal phuola kuon a tapa thumte’ min pen, a tapen Eliab, ama zomah Abinadab, le a thumna Shammah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David a tumpen ahi hi; a tapen thum in Saul a zui vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahi vangin Bethlehem-a a pa’ tuute va dingin Saul kung panin David kuon zelin a tung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni sawmli sung zingmawng nitahin Philistia-pa pei-in a va ding let ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jessi in a tapa David kungah, “Na ute puoh dingin tami ankan ephah khat le tam anlum sawm guong inlen, giephuolah na ute kungah a mallangin va puoh in,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tam bawngnawi khal pheng sawmte zong tawi inlen, tul a uh galkapmangpa puoh in. Na ute’ luhin suongpo dan va mu ta’nlen, amate tung panin melcina themkhat hing tawi ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua laitahin Saul, amate, le Israel mi zosie Elah kuomah a om vua, Philistia-te tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jessi thu pieh bangin zingmawng phalvahin David tho a, a cing ding mi khat tawh a tuute nuasie-in a ante puo-in a pei hi. Galsim dinga kithawi galkap honpite in galdo kikona a awh lai tahun giephuolah David a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel le Philistia-te, a kido dingin galkap le galkap a kiguol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in van cing pa’ khut sungah a an puohte nuasie-in galkapte kungah a tai a, ama pei-in a sanggamte a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate tawh a kiho laitahin Philistia gal makaite sung pan Gath-a Philistia-te’ makai Goliath min nei pa pusuohin a masa-a a thugen teng ma a gen hi. Tuale David in a thugen a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel-te zosie in tua mipa a mu ciengun ama kung panin taimangin a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel-te in, “Tami ang peito pa na mu vuoi? Israel-te a tawh dinga ang peito tahtah ahi hi. Kumpipa in ama a that zo mipa tungah sum tampi tawh patawi-in a tanu tawh kinungsah ding a, Israel sungah ama’ innkuonte suotahna a pie ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David in a gei-a ding mite kungah, “Tam Philistia-pa thatin Israel tung panin zakona a lamang pa adingin bang kibawlpieh ding ahei?” a ci hi. Hingzing Pasien’ galkapte a tawh valiang dingin tami a tep kitan lo Philistia-pa khu koi hi viel ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite in ama a kibang ngiamin a dawng vua, “Ama a that mipa tungah tua a kigensa bangin kibawl ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David in mite kungah thu a gen laitahin a u tapen Eliab in na za hi; tuale David tungah Eliab a sinso a, “Bang dinga hing peisuh na hiei? Gamlahah tuu tawmnote koi tawh nang nuasie ahiei? Na kimot muonna le na lungsim gitlona ka thei hi; azieh pen gal kidona en lel dinga hing peisuh hi bo teh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David in, “Tu-in ke’n bang ka bawl ei? Thu dawhna maimai khat hi lel bo” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama kung panin midang khat kungah kihei-in a gen ngaiteng ma a gen hi.; tuale mite in a masa-a bangin a dawngkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David’ thugente a kizah bepin amate in Saul kungah a gensawn vua, tuale Saul in ama hlansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in Saul kungah, “Ama ziehin koima lungkiesah sin; na nasempa pei-in tami Philistia-pa tawh va kisuol ta vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul in David kungah, “Tam Philistia-pa tawh kisuol dingin pei thei sih va teh; bangzieh ahei cile nang naupangno khat na hi na bo a, ama a tangval lai-a kipanin galhang mi khat a na hi ta bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin David in Saul kungah, “Na nasempa in a pa’ tuute ka cing let hi; tuale humpi ahi a, vompi ahi zongin ang pei-in tuute lah panin tuunote ang taw sielin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />keima in tuate nuadelin ka satpua a, a kam sung panin tuuno ka lahpieh hi; tuale ei pet dingin ang din ciengin a khagu-ah manin vat gawpin ka that ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na nasempa in humpi le vompi a nipi-in a that ngai zo ta hi; ama in hingzing Pasien’ galkapte a tawh viel ziehin a tep kitan lo tami Philistia-pa zong tuate khat tawh kibang lel ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David in, “Humpi kecin le vom kecin pana ei hunkhie ahi tua Topa in tami Philistia-pa’ khut sung panin zong ei hunkhie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Saul in David kungah, “Va pei ta’n, nang tawh Topa hing om taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul in a galvante David silsah hi; ama in a lu tungah sumngo lukhu khusah a, sia songkhol a silsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in a galvan tungah Saul’ namsau kuo a, tuate tawh ama kingainase nai lo ahi ziehin pei dingin a kisah leh a pei thei sih hi. Tua bepin David in Saul kungah, “Tam teng tawh lam ka pei thei sih hi; azieh pen tamte tawh ka kingainase nai sih hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David in tuate a suodawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a khutah a ciengkhut tawi-in lui panin a zol kilkel suongtang nga tengin tuucinna thungpi sungah tuate a guong hi; ama in a khut sungah a saili tawi-in Philistia-pa kung a zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Philistia-pa pei-in a mai-ah a lum tawipa tawh a pei David lam a neh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Philistia-pa khuodahin David a mu ciengin ama pen a cisan suoh, a mel hoi tangval no khat ahi nah bo ziehin a simmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Philistia-pa in David kungah, “Cieng tawh ka kunga nang kuon nadingin kei ui ka hi amah?” a ci hi. Philistia-pa in a pasiente’ min tawh David a samsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philistia-pa in David kungah, “Ka kungah hing pei in, hui lahah vate le gamlah gamsate tungah na sa ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanle David in Philistia-pa kungah, “Ka kungah namsau, teipi, le teikhaw tawh nang kuon hi; hizongle nangma in na tawh vagiap Israel galkapte’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa’ min tawh na kunga ang kuon ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuni-in Topa in ka khut sungah nang ei pie ding a, nang hing satlia-in na lu ka tansan ding hi; tuale tuni mama-in hui lahah a leng vate le leitung gamsate tungah Philistia galkap a site’ luonghawm ka pie ding hi. Israel sungah Pasien khat a op lam leitung mi zosie in a theithei nading ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa in namsau le teipi tawh a hutkhiet lo lam tam muna kikhawm mi zosie in a theithei nading uh ahi hi; bang zieh ahei cile galdona pen Topa a’ hi a, ama in ka khut sung vuah note ei pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />David tawh kisuol dingin Philistia-pa in David a neh tehteh ciengin, David zong Philistia-pa tawh kisuol dingin galkapte gal kidona mun zuonin mallangin a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />David in a khut tawh a thungpi sung sawh a, suongtang khat la-in a kap leh Philistia-pa’ talpang a kha hi; a talpangah tua suongtang tumsuhin ama tuoltang sena-in kinei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in saili khat le suongtang khat tawh Philistia-pa zo a, Philistia-pa satpuo-in that hi; David’ khut sungah namsau a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ciengin David tai-in Philistia-pa tungah a ding hi; ama in Philistia-pa’ namsau manin a pai pan dawh a, tuale ama that hi; tua ciengin ama in tua tawh a lu a tan hi. Philistia-te in a galhangpa uh si a mu ciengun a taimang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel le Judah galkap-te awngin a ding vua, Gath le Ekron kulkotpi cieng dongah Philistia-te a del vua, Shaaraim lampi dung panin Gath le Ekron dongin gal sunga a liem Philistia mite a puamat sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Philistia-te a delna panun Israel-te kilekia-in a giephuol uh a bulu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />David in Philistia-pa’ lutang la-in Jerusalem ah peipi hi; ahi vangin ama in a puonbuh sungah a galvan teng koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Saul in Philistia-te do dinga a kuon David a mu ciengin ama in galkapmangpa Abner kungah, “Abner, tami tangvalpa khu koi’ tapa ahiei?” a ci hi. Abner in, “Nang a hing na hi ma bangin kumpipa aw, ka thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Tua tangvalno koi’ tapa ahei, dong in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Philistia-pa a thana panin David kilekia a, Abner in a khut sunga a tawi Philistia-pa’ lutang tawh Saul mai-ah ama a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Saul in ama kungah, “Tangvalpa, koi’ ta na hiei?” a ci hi. David in, “Bethlehem-a na nasempa Jessi’ tapa ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in Saul a hopi zaw-in Jonathan’ lungsim le David’ lungsim kikhiton a, Jonathan in ama’ pumpi za-in ama a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in khum ni panin ama kungah David omsah a, a pa’ inn ah a peisah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in a pumpi za-in David a it ziehin ama tawh thuciemna khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in a sil lai a puontuolpi sutin a galvante, a namsau, a thalpi, le a kawngga nasan David a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul’ sawlna khat popo-ah David pei-in a matun ahi ziehin Saul in a galkapte a uh dingin ama a koi hi. Mi zosie, Saul’ nasemte nangawn zong a lungkim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Philistia-pa a thana panin David pei-in, amate in inn lam a zot ciengun, Kumpi Saul dawn dingin tawm neute le tumgingte tawi-in Israel khuopi zosie sung panin a lam kawmun lasa-in numeite a pusuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A guolnop kawmun numeite khatlekhat in la a sa vua, “Saul in a tulin that, David in a tul sawmin that,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam lasahna ziehin Saul lungthah mama a, tua in ama lungkimsah vet lo hi. Ama in, “ David a tul sawma thatin a gen vua, kei a tul beh thatin ei gen uhi. Kumpi’ min ka puoh simlo bang nei nawn ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-a kipanin Saul in David a encih den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zing ciengin Pasien kung panin hlagau gilo khat in Saul bawh a, tuale nisima a bawl ngai bangin David in lyre lasahna a tum laitahin a inn sungah Saul a hang gawp hi. Saul in a khut sungah a teipi a tawi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuale Saul in a teipi a khaw hi, azieh pen ama in, “Kawm tawh David kiltha vang,” ci-in a ngaisun hi. Hizongle a ni vei-in David kihem man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in ama ompi-in ahi vangin Saul kung panin a kihep dawh ziehin Saul in David a giing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in ama kung panin David hemkhie-in ama mihing tulkhat uhin koi hi; tuale David kuonin galkapte a makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sepna bangkimah David a lawcing hi; azieh pen Topa in ama a ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in lawcinna lienpi a nei lam Saul in a mu ciengin lamdangsa-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel le Judah zosie in David a it uhi; azieh pen sungtum pusuohin amate a makai pa khu ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in David kungah, “Tanah ka tanu a tapen Merab a om hi; na zi dingin ama kang pie ding hi; kei adingin hangsan lel inlen Topa’ gal do in,” a ci hi. Azieh pen Saul in, “Ama tungah ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi; Philistia-te in kisep ta uheh,” ci-in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in Saul kungah, “Kumpipa’ mahpa hi thei nadingin kei koi ka hi a, Israel sungah ka tanaute, le ka pa’ innkuonte koi ahi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin David tungah Saul’ tanu Merab a kipieh ding hun tah ciengin Meholah-te Adriel tungah a zi dingin tua nu kipiezaw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Saul’ tanu Michal in David a ngai hi. Saul kungah tua thu a kigen ciengin ama lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Ama adingin thaang ahi thei nading le ama tungah Philistia-te’ khut a tuh thei nadingin ama tungah tua nu piesah vang,” ci-in ngaisun hi. Tua ziehin Saul in David kungah a ni veina genin, “Tu-in nang ka mahpa ding na hi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul in a nasemte thu pie a, “David dap hopi unlen ama kungah, ‘En in, na tungah kumpipa lungkim a, a nasem zosie in nang ang it uhi. Tua ahi ciengin tu-in kumpipa’ mahpa suoh in,’ ci-un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul’ nasemte in David kungah tam thu teng a gendap uhi. Tuale David in, “Kei mizawng mingau le a vangta khat ka hi lam mu napi-in kumpipa’ mahpa hi thei nading khu thuneu na sa uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul’ nasemte in ama kungah, “David in a hici gen ma hi bo,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in, “David kungah tam bangin na gen ding uhi, ‘Kumpipa in a galte tungah phu a lah thei nadingin Philistia-te’ vuntep zakhat ci simlo bangma moman a dei sih hi,’ na ci ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tu-in Saul in Philistia-te’ khut lumin David a sisah sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nasemte in David tungah tam bang thute a gen ciengun kumpipa’ mahpa a hi ding pen David lungkim mama hi. A kini ciem uh a tawp masangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David tho-in a mite tawh kuon a, Philistia-te mi zakhat a that uhi. Kumpipa’ mahpa suo thei nadingin kumpipa tungah a kima kipie ding amau’ vuntepte David in a va puoh ta hi. Tuale Saul in a zi dingin a tanu Michal ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in David a ompi lam le Saul’ tanu Michal in ama a ngai lam a thei ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Saul in David a giingzaw kan lai hi. Tuaci’n Saul khu khum huna kipanin David’ gal ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin gal do dingin Philistia galkapmangte a kuonkhiet simin Saul’ nasem zosie sangin David in guol a zozaw hi. Tua ahi ziehin David a minthang semsem hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul in a tapa Jonathan le a nasem zosie kungah David tha ding thu a gen hi. Ahi vangin Saul’ tapa Jonathan in David a pahta mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jonathan in David kungah, “Ka pa in nang ang tha sawm hi; tua ziehin zingcieng zingmawngin kikemcing in; a sipna mun khatah va kiphuol ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima hing pei-in nangma’ opna gamlahah ka pa gei-ah kang ding ding a, ka pa tawh nang vai ka va kiho ta ding hi; bang khatpo ka zah leh na kungah kang gen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in a pa Saul kungah David genpha a, a kungah, “Na nasempa David tungah kumpipa maw kha malmal sin; azieh pen nang tungah ama ang maw ngai sih a, a sil bawlte nang adingin a hoi vive ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Philistine-pa tawh a kido lai-in ama’ khut sungah a nuntahna a kham ziehin Topa in Israel-te zosie adingin guolzawna lienpi piengsah hi. Nangma in tam thu na mitin na mu a, na lungdam hi; tua ahi ziehin thu om lopi-in bang dingin David thana tawh maw nei lo mipa tungah maw ding na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Jonathan thugen a mang hi; Saul kiciem a, “Ama kithat poma lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jonathan in ama kungah David hlanin tam thu zosie a gen hi. Tua ciengin Jonathan in Saul kungah David zawpi a, a nidanga ma bangin a sepna ngai-ah a semkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gal kidona khatvei omkia a, Philistia-te do dingin David a kuon hi. David in amate nahpi tahin do a, a mai-ah amate a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khut sungah teipi tawi-in a inn sungah Saul a to laitah, David in tumging a tum laitahin Topa kung panin hlagau gilo khat Saul tungah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul in a teipi-in David kawm tawh kiltha ding a sawm a, ahi vangin ama in Saul pelh a, tuaci’n kawmah a teipi kiphut hi. Khum ni zanin David taimangin a suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in David’ inn a encih dingin kamtaite sawl a, zingmawng ciengin ama tha a sawm hi. David’ zi Michal in ama kungah, “Tu zanin na hinna na hutdam sih leh zing ciengin ang kithat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Michal in tawlet panin David khiesuh hi; tuale ama tai-in a suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Michal in milim khat la-in a lupna tungah koi hi; tua nu in a lutang sonah kelmul tangkham khat khamsahin puon tawh khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul in David man dingin kamtaite a sawl ciengin ama in, “Ama a ci na hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in David en dingin kamtaite a sawl hi. Ama in, “Ama ka tha thei nadingin a lupna pumin hing peipi to ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kamtaite a tun ciengun a lutunga kelmul tuomna tawh a kikhu milim khat lupna tungah na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in Michal kungah, “Bang dinga tam banga nei sol a, ama a suotah nadinga ka galpa na taisah ahei?” a ci hi. Michal in Saul dawng a, “Ama in ka kungah, ‘Ei peisah in; bang dinga nang kang tha ding ahei?’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in David taimangin suohta hi; Ramah-a Samuel kungah ama pei-in, Saul in a tunga a bawlsiet dan zosie a gen hi. Ama le Samuel pei-in Naioth khuo-ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul kungah, “Ramah-a Naioth khua-ah David om hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in David man dingin kamtaite a sawl hi. Samuel in makai-in kamsang honte lamin awngin a op uh amate in a mu ciengun Saul’ kamtaite tungah Pasien’ hlagau tungin amate zong lamin awngin kam a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul kungah tam thu a kigen ciengin ama in adang kamtaite sawlkia a, amate zong lamin awngin a om uhi. Saul in a thum veina kamtaite sawlkia a, amate zong lamin awngin a om veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua bepin amama Ramah ah pei a, Secu -a om tuikul lienpi-ah a tung hi; ama in, “Samuel le David hei-a om gel ahei?” ci-in a dong hi. Tuale mi khat in, “Ama gel Ramah-a Naioth khua-ah a om uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama zong Ramah-a Naioth manaw-in a pei hi; tuale a tungah Pasien’ hlagau a tung hi. Ramah-a Naioth mun a tun masang a pei kawmin lamin awngin ama in kam a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in a puon suodawhin Samuel mai-ah lamin awngin a om hi. Khum ni sun tungtawn le zan tungtawnin a guohtangin ama a om hi. Tua ahi ziehin, “Kamsangte lahah Saul zong a kihal ta amah?” kici hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ramah-a Naioth panin David a taimang hi. Jonathan kungah tungin ama mai-ah, “Bang ahiei ka bawl? Bang ahiei ka khielna? Ama in kei ei thasawm valia nadingin na pa tunga ka mawna bang ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ama kungah, “Hing that laizang lo e! Si malmal sih vateh. Ka pa in kei thei loin thuneu hile thulien hile bangma a bawl ngai sih hi; tuale bang dingin ka pa in tam thu kei kungah ei pha ding ahei? Ei pha malmal sih va!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin David zong kiciem a, “Na pa in kei nei patah lam a thei siem mama hi; tuale ama in, ‘Ama da luo ding ahi ziehin Jonathan theisah da vang,’ ci-in ngaisun hi. Hinanle a tahtahin Topa hingin nang mama zong na hin ma bangin, keima le sina kikalah kal khat beh om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in na gen popo kang bawlpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in Jonathan kungah, “Zing cieng hladet ni ahi a, kumpipa tawh sabuoi-a ka to lo ding a kilawm sih hi; ahi vangin a ni thum nitah dong lolai-ah ka kiphuol thei nadingin kei ei peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin kei ka om lo lam na pa in ei thei khah leh ama kungah, ‘David in ama’ khuo Bethlehem ah va tai pah tavang ci’n kei kungah limtahin ang kingen hi; azieh pen khum sungah ama’ innkuon zosie adingin kumsiel biehpiehna a om hi,’ na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Hoi e!’ a ci leh na nasempa adingin thu hoi hi ding hi; ahi vangin ama a thangpai leh sietna lam ngaisun zo hi, ci thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na nasempa mitgitna tawh ei bawl in; azieh pen nang tawh a siengtho thuciemna sungah na nasempa na tunpi hi. Ahi vangin kei sunga khielna a op leh nang mama in ei that in; bang dinga na pa kunga nei peipi ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Hing kithat laizang lo e! Ka pa in na tungah sietna a tunsah ding a ngaisut lam ka thei nah leh na kungah kang gen talawm sih ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Jonathan kungah, “Na pa in nang hing ngawh dawn taleh koi in kei ei gen ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathan in David dawng a, “Hing pei in, lolai-ah pei vai,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a ni gelin lo-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonathan in David kungah, “Israel Pasien, Topa’ minin ka kiciem hi! Zing cieng tu bang hunin ahi sihle a ni thum ni-in ka pa’ lungsim tawng kang kan zaw ciengin ama in David tungah lungsim pha a nei leh, mi sawlin na kungah hing theisah na lo ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka pa in nang tungah sietna ang bawl sawm a, tuale nang hing theisah loin bihtaha na pei nadingin kang sawl sih tah leh Topa in keima Jonathan ei dawm sih taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei ka hin lai khah leh kei tungah Topa’ thuman itna ei lah in; ahi vangin kei ka si tah leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa na ngawnin lei maitang panin David’ gal teng zosie sumang nanle keima innkuon panin na thuman itna sumang ngai vawt sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Jonathan in David’ innkuon tawh kiciemna khat bawlin ama in, “ Topa in David’ galte sulzui taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathan in zong ama a itna David tungah kiciempha kia hi; azieh pen ama’ pumpi a it za-in ama a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jonathan in ama kungah, “Zing cieng pen hladet ni ahi hi; na tona awng ding ahi ziehin nang ang kiphawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thai ciengin nang na peisuh ding hi; na kiphuol masahna munah pei inlen, khum sunga suongpi pangah om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in muiciem bangin khum lam galah thaltang thum kang kap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin naupang khat sawlin ama kungah, ‘Pei inlen, thaltangte va sui ta vawi,’ ka ci ding hi. Tua naupang kungah, ‘En vawi, thaltangte nangma kung talam galah tu hi, tung in,’ ka ci leh tua ciengin nang ang pei ding na hi hi, azieh pen Topa a hing ahi ma bangin nang dingin lungmuon huoi a, zauna om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin naupang kungah, ‘En vawi, thaltangte na gal khat lamah tu hi,’ ka ci leh peimang ta’n; azieh pen Topa in nang ang sawlmang ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang le kei in i gensa thu tawh kisai-in nang le kei kikalah Topa teci ahi zing hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n David lo-ah a kiphuol hi. Hladet ni a tun ciengin an ne dingin kumpipa a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nidanga bangin kawm gei-a a tona tung, ama’ tona-ah kumpipa a to hi. Saul’ gei-ah Abner a to laitahin Jonathan a ding hi; ahi vangin David’ mun a awng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul in khum ni-in bangma gen lo hi; azieh pen ama in, “Ama tungah thu bang ahiei khat pieng hi ding hi; ama sienglo hi, ama a sieng lo tahtah ahi hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin a ni ni ni, hladet zaw a zing ni-in David’ tona a awng hi. Tuale Saul in a tapa Jonathan kungah, “Bang zieha Jessi’ tapa zani hile tuni hile an nehna-a ang pei lo ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jonathan in Saul dawng a, “Bethlehem-a pei dingin limtahin kei kungah David ang kingen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in, “Kei ei peisah in; azieh pen ka innkuonte khuo sunga biehpiehna bawl ding ahi vua, khum sunga om dingin ei thuta uhi. Tuaci’n tu-in nei hepina tawh ei peisah inlen ka sanggamte ei musah in,’ ei ci hi. Tami thu zieha kumpipa sabuoi-ah ama ang pei lo ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua bepin Jonathan tungah Saul a sin so hi. Ama kungah, “ A letat, a ledo numei’ tapa! Nang mama le na nu’ maizum nadingin Jessi’ tapa na panpina thu a thei lo ei sa na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Azieh pen leitungah Jessi’ tapa a hin laisie nangma na hi a, na kumpi gam ahi zongin kip lo ding hi. Tu-in va hlansah inlen ka kungah hing peipi in; a si valon ding ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in a pa Saul dawng a, “Bang zieha ama kithat ding ahei? Ama’n bang bawl ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahi vangin Saul in ama khaw dingin a teipi a vih hi; tuaci’n a pa in David a tha sawm lam Jonathan in a thei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sabuoi panin a lungthah sengin Jonathan dingdawh a, tua pawi a ni ni-in an zong a ne ta sih hi, azieh pen a pa in David mindaisah ahi ziehin David a dapi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zing ciengin David tawh a kiciemna lo-ah naupang khat zawpi-in Jonathan a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in naupang pa kungah, “Tai inlen ka thaltang kapte va tung ta vawi,” a ci hi. Naupang pa a tai lai tahin ama hlengin thaltang khat a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jonathan’ thaltang tuhna munah naupang pa a tun ciengin Jonathan in naupang pa hlan a, ama kungah, “Thaltang na galkhat lamah om hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jonathan in naupang pa hlan a, “Manlang in, kinaw inlen uoikai den sin,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Jonathan’ naupang pa in thaltangte khawmin a pupa kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahi vangin naupang pa in bangma a thei kha vateh sih a, Jonathan le David behin a silbawl a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathan in a galhiemte naupangpa pie a, ama kungah, “Pei inlen tam teng khuopi lamah na peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Naupang pa a pei zaw lienin suongcien pang panin David dingin lei-ah bawhsuh hi. Ama thumvei bawhsuhin, tuale ama gel khatlekhat kinamin khatlekhat a kikaa uhi; David a nah kaazaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jonathan in David kungah, “Ei gel Topa’ min tawh kiciemin, ‘Keima le nangma kikal le keima’ suonlehlahte le nangma’ suonlehlahte kikalah kumtawnin Topa ang om ding hi,’ i cisa ahi ziehin lungmuong tahin na pei in,” a ci hi. Ama dingin a pei hi; tuale Jonathan zong khuopi lamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nob khuo-a siempu Ahimelech kungah David haw hi. David dawn dingin Ahimelech a citunsa-in pei-in ama kungah, “Bang zieha nangma tanga hing pei-a koima tawh hing zawh lo na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in siempu Ahimelech kungah, “Kumpipa in na khat ei sawlin ka kungah, ‘Nang kang sawlna thu le kang hil thute koima theisah sin,’ ei ci hi. Tangvalte tawh khum mun khum mun tengah kimutuona ding khat ka bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin tu-in na khut sungah bang na nei ei? Anlum lum nga ahi sihle tana om popo khat ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siempupa in David dawng a, “Tutahin anlum mawhmawh ka nei sih hi, tangvalte khu numei pana a kikoicing zo po uleh- anlum siengtho beh ka nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in siempupa dawngin, “Ka peikhiet popo ciengun numei panin ka kikoicing den uhi; khuolzin mawhmawh cieng nangawnin zong tangvalte’ neitah a siengtho hi; tuni-in a neitahte uh bang za-in siengtho kan lai ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempupa in anlum siengtho ama a pie hi; bang ding ahei cile anlum a kilah ni-in anlum a lumlai tawh a kilaih pai ding, Topa mai pana a kila Ompina Anlum simlo anlum dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum ni-in tua tahah Topa mai-a kihen Saul’ nasemte khat a om hi; a min Doeg ahi a, Saul’ gancingte makai pa hi a, Edom-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Ahimelech kungah, “Teipi hile namsau hile khat beh na nei sih amah? Kumpipa nasepna a kinaw seng ziehin ka teipi hile ka namsau hile kang puo man ta sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siempupa in, “Elah kuoma na tha Philistia-pa Goliath’ namsau, puon tawh tunsa-in tanah siempipuon nua-ah a om hi; tua na dei leh kilah in, azieh pen tuami khat simlo tanah bangma om lo hi,” a ci hi. David in, “Tua bang adang om sih va; kei ei pie ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni-in David dingin Saul kung panin tai a, Gath kumpipa Achish kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Achish’ nasemte in ama kungah, “Tam mipa khu a gam kumpipa David hi lo amah? Khatlekhat laam kawmin la sa-in, ‘Saul in a tulin that, David in a tul sawmin that,’ ci-in a la tap pa uh hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David in a lungsimah tam thute ciemte a, Gath kumpipa Achish a giing mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in amate mai-ah a gamtat dan kheel a, a muna vuah a maw a kipang hi. A kulkotkhahte tung lah po kui gawp a, a khamul tungah a khatetui a kaisuhsah nianua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Achish in a nasemte kungah, “En un, tam mipa a maw ahi lam na mu uhi; tua ahile bang dinga ama ka kunga nang peipi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka opna-ah mimaw-a kibawl dingin tam mipa nang peipi nadingun kei mimawte kisam ka hi amah? Tam mipa ka inn sunga ang lut ding ahi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in khum mun a nuasie a, Adullam leihawm-ah a suohta hi; a sanggamte le a pa’ innkuon zosie in tua thu a zah ciengun khum mun ama kungah a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungkham poma, leiba nei poma, le a lungkim lo poma ama kungah a kituo uhi; tuale amate tungah ama makai a suoh hi. Ama tawh a omton mi zali tang bang pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum mun panin Moab gam Mizpah ah David a pei hi. Ama in Moab kumpipa kungah, “Pasien in keima dingin bang ei bawlpieh ding ahei ci ka thei masangin na kungah ka nu le ka pa hing omsah in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Moab kumpipa kungah ama gel nuasie a, mun muonhuoi sungah David a om hun sung zosie-in ama tawh a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsang Gad in David kungah, “Mun muonhuoi-ah om den sin; nuasie inlen Judah gam sungah pei in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David peikhie-in Hereth gammang lahah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David le a mite a opna kithei zo ci thu Saul in a za hi. A khut sungah a teipi tawi-in a kimvelah a nasemte zosie a ding vua, tuale Gibeah-a makeng singkung sang nei-ah Saul a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in a kimvela a ding a nasemte kungah, “Tu-in ngai un, no Benjamin-te aw; Jessi’ tapa in note zosie tungah lo le lengga umte hing pie-in a tul uh, a za uhin ang koi ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang dingin na unpi-un kei ei sawmdap na hi uh ahei? Ka tapa in Jessi’ tapa tawh kipawlna a bawl ciengin koima khat beh in nei theisah sih vua, tuni-a kibawl bangin ka tapa in kei ei do-in ei na lambuh nadingin ka nasempa a hantawhna vai-ah zong koima na da vateh sih vua, ka kungah zong nei gen vawt sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom mi Saul’ nasemte makai Doeg in dawng a, “Nob khuo-a Ahitub’ tapa Ahimelech kungah Jessi’ tapa a haw lam ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa kungah ama adingin thu a dawhpieh a, neh le tah pie-in Philistia-pa’ namsau zong ama a pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in Ahitub’ tapa Ahimelech le a pa’ innkuonte ahi Nob khuo-a siempu zosie hlansah hi; tuale amate a unpi-un kumpipa kungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul in, “Ahitub’ tapa aw, tu-in ngai in,” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Tanah om ing, ka pu aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul in ama kungah, “Bang dingin nang le Jessi’ tapa kidap kupin kei ei do na hi uh ahei? Ama in tuni-a a bawl bangin kei ei ledo-in ei na buh thei nadingin an le tui le namsau pie-in bang dingin Topa kungah ama ading thu dawhpieh na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ahimelech in kumpipa dawng a, “Na nasem zosie lahah David bangin koi thuman ahei? Ama kumpipa’ tupa ahi a, sep dinga na sawlte ama in nawsep a, na inn sungah ama a kipatawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama dingin Pasien kungah thu ka dawhpieh tuni a masa pen ahi amah? Hi vawt lo hi! Kumpipa in a nasemte tungah hile ka pa’ innkuonte khatpo tungah hile mawsah sin; azieh pen na nasempa in tam thute khat popo-ah a tam hile a tawm hile bangma a thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ahimelech, nang le na pa’ innkuonte a si valon ding na hi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama’ kiima ading a cingte kungah, “Kihei-in Topa’ siempute that un, azieh pen amate zong David tawh pangton uhi; amate in ama a tai lam a thei geguh uh kei ei ko lo uhi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Topa’ siempute do dingin kumpipa’ nasemte in a khut uh a lamto sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua bepin kumpipa in Doeg kungah, “Doeg, nangma kihei inlen siempute that in,” a ci hi. Edom mi Doeg kihei pai-in siempute a phiel hi; khum ni-in ama in saihadiel siempu puontuol a sil mi sawmgiet le nga tah that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in siempute’ khuo ahi Nob khuo namsau tawh a vatmai hi; ama in namsau tawh numei le pasal, naupang le naungeh, a bawngtang, a laa le a tuute dongin a that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ahitub’ tapa, Ahimelech’ tapate lahah Abiathar a kici khat suohta a, David kungah a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abiathar in David kungah Saul in Topa’ siempute a tha lam a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in Abiathar kungah, “Khum ni-in Doeg khum tahah om ahi ziehin ama in Saul kungah gen valon va, ci ka thei hi. Na pa’ innkuonpi mi zosie’ sina khu keima zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima kungah om inlen zau sin; bangzieh ahei cile tha dinga kei ei suite in nang zong tha dinga ang sui ahi hi; Keima tawh bihtahin na om ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in amate in David kungah, “Philistia-te in Keilah simin ancilna munte a bulu uhi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Topa dong a, “Pei-in Philistia-te ka bulu diei mah?” a ci hi. Topa in David kungah, “Pei in Philistia-te bulu inlen, Keilah hunkhie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin David’ mite in ama kungah, “En in, Judah gam tami sunga ki-om bawn i zau lai uhi; Philistia-te sim dingin Keilah ah va kuon ta leih bangza-in i zauzaw kan lai ding vuoi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Topa dong phakia hi. Topa in ama dawng a, “Ingheh, Keilah ah peisuh in; bang ding ahei cile na khut sungah Philistia-te kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Keilah ah David le a mite a pei vua, Philistia-te tawh kido-in a ganhonte uh a lahpieh vua, amate zong tampitah a that uhi. Tua bangin David in Keilah mite a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keilah-a David kungah Ahimelech’ tapa Abiathar a tai ciengin a khut sungah siempipuon khat tawh peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keilah ah David tung zo hi, ci thu Saul kungah kigen hi. Tuale Saul in, “Pasien in ka khut sungah ama ei pie zo ta hi; bangzieh ahei cile kulkotpite le siazawl kotgolh a nei khuopi sung khatah lutin ama le ama a kikhalu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in galsim ding, Keilah-a kuonsuh ding, David le a mite imtawm dingin mi zosie a thuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in ama tungah sietna bawl ding a sawm lamtah David in a thei ciengin ama in siempu Abiathar kungah, “Na siempipuon tanah hing peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in, “Israel Pasien, Topa aw, keima ziehin khuopi a susie dingin Keilah ah Saul ang kuon hi, ci thu na nasempa in za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale tu-in na nasempa’ zah bangin Saul ang kuonsuh ding amah? Israel’ Pasien, Topa aw, na nasempa ei gen in, kang thum hi,” a ci hi. Topa in ama kungah, “Ama ang kuonsuh ding ma ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in, “Keilah mite in Saul’ khut sungah kei le ka mite ei ap ding uh amah?” a ci hi. Topa in, “Ang ap ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bepin David le a mite zaguh tang khat dingdawhin Keilah a nuasie uhi; a pei theina popo vuah a pei uhi. Keilah panin David a suotahna thu Saul kungah a kigen ciengin ama in a vai a khawl phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziph Senel muoltung gam sung, senel gam sung mun muonhuoi-ah David a om hi. Nisielin Saul in ama sui a, ahi vangin Topa! in ama’ khut sungah David pie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in tha dinga a sui kawi a thei ciengin Ziph Senel gam Horesh ah David a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Horesh khuo-a om David kunga haw dingin Saul’ tapa Jonathan a kuon hi; ama in Topa tungtawnin khum munah a khutte a hatsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in David kungah, “Zau malmal sin; azieh pen ka pa Saul’ khut in nang ang mu sih ding hi; nang pen Israel tungah kumpi na hi ding a, kei nang zom ka hi ding hi; ka pa Saul in zong tam thu thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa mai-ah a ni gelin thuciemna a bawl uhi; Horesh ah David om lai a, Jonathan a inn ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gibeah-a Saul kungah Ziph-te peito-in ama kungah, “Jeshimon leitaw lam Hachilah muoltunga om Horesh mun muonhuoite sung kote lahah David kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, tu-in nang peisuh nuom hunin hing peisuh in; kote bawl ding ahile na khut sungah ama kang pieh ding uh ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Kei tungah lainatna nang nei ziehun Topa in thupha hing buoh ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Va pei inlen va kiciensah lai ta’n; ama hei sung mun liena om hi a, tuale khum sungah koi in ama mu ahei, ci va thei ta’n; bangzieh ahei cile ama pen a pilkhel mama ahi hi, ci-in ka kungah ei kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kimvel en kawikawi-in a kibuhna muntah hing thei unlen, thu kicien tawh ka kungah hing peikia un. Tua ciengin noma tawh kang pei ding hi; gam sungah ama a op leh Judah a tul tampite lah panin ka longdawh teitei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a ding vua, Ziph-a pei dingin Saul masangah a na mapei uhi. Jeshimon leitaw lam Arabah gam sung Maon senel gamah David le a mite a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul le a mite pei-in ama a sui uhi. A kisui lam David kunga a kigen ciengin ama suongpi-ah peisuhin Maon senel gamah a om hi. Saul in tua thu a zah bepin Maon senel gam dongah David a del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Muol pang khatah Saul pei a, David le a mite muol pang lang khatah a pei uhi. Saul le a mite in David le a mite man dingin a nai semsem ciengun, Saul kung panin a suotah thei nadingin David a nawtai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul kungah kamtai khat tungin ama in, “Kinaw inlen hing pei in. Bangzieh ahei cile Philistia-te in gam sung ei sim uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in David a nuadel khawl a, Philistia-te sim dingin a kuon hi; tua ahi ziehin khum mun pen Suotahna Suongpi kici hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum mun panin David peito-in En-gedi mun muonhuoite sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul in Philistia-te a nuadelna panin a kilekia ciengin ama kungah, “En-gedi senel gamah David om hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in Israel zosie sung panin a kituomteel pasal tul thum zawpi-in Gamkel Suongpi lamah David le a mite sui dingin a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lam gei-a tuubuhte gei-ah ama pei a, khum tahah leihawm khat a om hi; tuale awnghaw dingin Saul tua sungah a lut hi. Tua leihawm sungtawng penah David le a mite na to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David’ mite in ama kungah, “ Topa in, ‘Na khut sungah na galpa kang pie ding a, pha na sah bangin ama tungah na bawl ding hi,’ ei ci ni khu tuni ahi ta hi,” a ci uhi. Tua ciengin David pei-in Saul’ puontuol tep a dap tanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin a puontuol tep a tansan ziehin David a lung a nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a mite kungah, “ Topa’ sathau nu pa ahi ka Topa tungah tam banga ka khut hlan khah ding pen Topa in ei kham hi; bang ding ahei cile ama pen Topa’ sathau nu pa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in a mite nahpi tahin phawhsie a, Saul a do ding uh a phal sih hi. Tua ciengin Saul tho-in leihawm nuasie a, a pei nading lampi-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin David zong tho-in leihawm pan pusuohin Saul a nua hlat a, “Ka pu kumpipa!” a ci hi. Saul kinua hei-in a et ciengin David in a mai tuol ngatin khupbawhin zatahna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Saul kungah, “Bang ding a, ‘David in na siet nading sui hi,’ a ci mite’ thugen ngai na hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuni mama-in Topa in nang leihawm sung, ka khut sungah ei pieh lam na mit-in na mu zo ta hi; tuale mi pawlkhat in nang a that dingin ei tawh vua, ahi vangin ken nang kang hinkhawi hi. Keima in, ‘Ka pu tungah ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile ama pen Topa’ sathau nu pa ahi hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa aw, ka khut sunga na puontuol tep khu en vawi; azieh pen kei khutah khielna ahi a, kumpi langpanna ahi zongin a op lona, na puontuol tep tansanin nangma kang tha lona thu tawh a kicienin na thei ding hi,” a ci hi. Nang in kei tha dingin nei sui vangin nang tungah kei ka khiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in nang le kei kikalah thu khen taheh! Topa in na tungah ka phu la taheh; ahi vangin keima in nang tungah ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khanglui paunah khatah, ‘Mi gilote panin gitlona hing pieng,’ a ci bang ahi hi; ahi vangin nang tungah ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel kumpipi koi do dinga hing kuon na hei? A koi pen nuadel na hei? Ui si khat amah? Uihih khat ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin thukhenpa khu Topa hi hinlen, ama in nang le kei kikalah thu khen taheh. Ama in tam thu van hinlen ka vai ei panpi-in nang langkhatah ka dihna hing talang taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in Saul kungah tam thu teng a gen zaw ciengin Saul in, “Tami nang awsuo amah, ka tapa David?” a ci hi. Saul awngin a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in David kungah, “Kei sangin nang na thumanzaw hi; azieh pen keima in nang tungah a sie ka bawl laitahin nang in kei tungah a pha tawh nei thuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in na khut sungah ei koih laitahin nang in kei ei that loin nei limbawlna tuni-in nei tel gen zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bang zieh ahei cile koi in a galpa mu-in bihtahin peisah ding ahei? Tuaci’n tuni-in kei tungah nei bawlna ziehin Topa in sil hoi tawh thaman hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in nang kumpi a suoh valon ding na hi, ci ka thei hi. Na khut sungah Israel kumpi gam kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ziehin keima nua-a ka suon ka hlahte thatgam loin ka pa’ innkuon panin ka min na suhmang lo nadingin Topa’ min tawh ka kungah hing kiciem in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul tungah David a kiciem hi. Tua ciengin Saul a inn ah a pei hi; ahi vangin mun muonhuoi-ah David le a mite a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Samuel a si hi; tuale Israel zosie a kikhawm vua, ama ziehin kapin mau-in a om uhi. Amate in Ramah-a a inn ah ama a vui uhi. Tua ciengin David tho-in Paran senel gamah a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon ah mi khat om a, a nasepna pen Carmel ah a om hi. Tua mipa hau mama hi; ama in tuu tulthum le keel tulkhat nei hi. Carmel ah ama in tuumul a met hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua mipa’ min Nabal ahi a, a zinu’ min Abigail ahi hi. Tua numei in tei le melhoi thuo a, ahi vangin a pasal pen omdan thei lo le a gamtatsie khat ahi hi; ama pen Caleb-te khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nabal in tuumul heu hi, ci thu David in senel gamah a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in tangval sawm sawl a, tuale David in tua tangvalte kungah, “Carmel ah va peito ta un, tuale Nabal kungah va haw ta ulen ka min tawh ama va hopi ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam bangin ama na hopi ding uhi: ‘Nang tungah nopna om taheh, na innkuonpite tungah nopna om taheh, na neisa zosie tungah zong nopna om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang in tuumul heu mi na nei hi, ci thu ka na za hi; ko kungah na tuucingte om a, amate bangma ka law sih uhi, amate in Carmel-a a op sung tengun bangma khat beh a mansuo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tangvalte uh dong locin amate in nang kungah ang gen ding uhi. Tua ahi ziehin ka tangvalte in maipha musah in; azieh pen pawi ni-a hing tung ka hi uhi. Na khut sunga na nei bang bang na tapa David le na nasemte tungah ei pie ta’n, kang thum hi,’ ci un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangvalte a tun ciengun David’ min tawh tam thu zosie Nabal kungah a gen uhi; tua ciengin amate in a ngah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Nabal in David’ nasemte dawng a, “David koi ahiei? Jessi’ tapa koi ahiei? Tulai-in a pute kung pana a taimang nasem tampi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hei pana hing puoh ci ka thei lote tungah ka anlum le ka tui le ka tuumul heute dinga ka gaw ka sate la-in pie ding ka hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n David’ tangvalte kilekia-in a tun ciengun tam thu zosie ama kungah a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in a mite kungah, “Mi zosie in na namsau uh kuo ciet un!” a ci hi. Tuale mi zosie in a namsau a kuo ciet uhi; David in zong a namsau a kuo hi; tuale mi zali tang khat in David a zui vua, van ngahin mi za ni a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle tangval khat in Nabal’ zinu Abigail kungah thu gen a, “Ka pupa uh hopi dingin David in senel gam panin kamtai a sawl hi; tuale ama in amate a na hosie gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle kote tungah tua mite a hoi mama vua, sietna zong ka thuoh sih vua, amate tawh ka opton sung tengun lolai-ah zong bangma zamtawng ka mansuo sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate tawh tuu cinga ka opton sungun sun le zanin pal bangin ei dal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in tam thu thei inlen, na bawl ding kingaituo in; azieh pen ama khansie-in koima’n hopi thei lo ahi ziehin ka pu ule a innkuon zosie tungah sietna tunsah ding kingaituo zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abigail kinaw mama-in anlum lum zani le lenggazu savun tuithawl dim ni, tuu a minsa nga, ankan law nga, a kiphogaw lengga bawh zakhat, le theiga tawh kibawl moh zani la-in laa tungah tua teng guong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale a nasemte kungah, “Na pei masa un; na nua uh kang zui ding hi,” a ci hi. Hizongle ama in a pasal Nabal kungah gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama nu laa tungah tuongin muol pang a gei lai tahin, ama lamah David le a mite a pei uhi; tuale ama nu in amate na dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in David in, “Tam mipa’ neisa zosie bangma khat beh a pelem lo nadingin senel gama ka na cinpieh pen a mawhna suoh hi; ama in ka nasep hoite a sie tawh ei thuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin a nei zosie lahah pasal khat nangawn ka hinkhawi tah ma leh Pasien in keima David ei dawm sih taheh,” a na ci zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abigail in David a mu ciengin nawtai-in a laa tung pan kumsuhin David mai-ah pua-in tuolah a bawhsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama khupbawhin ama kungah, “Ka pu aw, tua khielna keima tung behah hing tu taheh; na nasemnu in na bilkawmah thu ei gensah inlen, na nasemnu’ thugen ei ngaipieh in, ci-in kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka pu in tam mi khansie Nabal thupi ngaisut malmal sin; azieh pen a min banga ama a gamta ahi lel bo hi; a min Nabal ahi a, ama mimaw ahi bo hi; ahi vangin ka pu in nang sawl tangvalte keima na nasemnu in ka na mukha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Tua ahi ciengin tu-in ka pu aw, Topa hingin nang zong na hin ma bangin, sisan suosahna tawh na khiel nading le na khut tawh phu na lah nading panin Topa in ang hloh bangin, tu-in na galte le ka pupa tunga siet nading a suite Nabal bang ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu-in na nasemnu in ka pupa kang puoh tami letsong pen ka pupa nuazui tangvalte ei piesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na nasempa’ gamtat khielna ei maisah in, kang thum hi; azieh pen ka pu in Topa’ galte na do ziehin Topa’ in ka pu innkuon hing kipsah tahtah ding a, na hin laisie-in nang sungah sietna a kimu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi khatpo in tha dinga ang del leh Topa na Pasien in a hing mite a humbihna sungah ka pu’ hinna a humbih ding hi; ahi vangin ama in saili kap bangin na galte hinna a kapmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in nang tawh kisai-a thu hoi a gensa zosie tawh kizui-in, Israel tungah kumpi dingin nang ang koi zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />thu om lopi-in sisan luonsahna zieh ahi a, ahi sihle ama le ama a kihutdamna ziehin ahi zongin, ka pu in lungsim gimna ding thu ahi a, lungsim natna ding thu ahi zongin na nei sih ding hi. Topa in ka pupa ang limbawl ciengin na nasem nu ei phawh bo in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David in Abigail kungah, “Tuni-in kei ei vaidot dinga nang ang sawl Israel’ Pasien Topa in thupha nga taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuni-in mithana le keima’ khut tawh phulah nading panin kei ei kem nangma le na ngaisut siemna in thupha nga taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma ang liemsah nading panin ei kham Israel’ Pasien Topa a hin tahtah ma bangin, kei ei dawn dingin a mallangin ang pei lo khat hi poma lacin, zing ciengin Nabal’ pasal khat zong ka hinkhawi vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in tua nu tung panin a puohte a sang hi; ama in tua nu kungah, “Na inn ah lungnuomin na peito in; en in, keima in na thu ka ngai zo a, na ngetnate kang pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nabal kungah Abigail tung a, ama in a inn ah kumpipa pawi tawh a kibang khat a na bawl hi. Zu kham seng ahi ziehin Nabal a lung a nuom mama hi; tuaci’n tua nu in ama kungah zingmawng khuova masangsie-in bangma a gen sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zingmawng cieng, Nabal a zukham a ven ciengin a zi in ama kungah tam thu teng a gen hi; tuale a lungtang si-in ama suongtum bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua zaw ni sawm bang ciengin Topa in Nabal vat a, tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in Nabal a si thu a zah ciengin ama in, “Ka tungah Nabal’ ei zakona ei thuhpiehin sietna panin a nasempa ei kem Topa in thupha nga taheh; Topa in Nabal’ gitlona amama a lukhuhsah kia hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin David in mi sawlin a zi dingin Abigail a helsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Carmel-a Abigail kungah David’ nasemte a tun ciengun ama kungah, “David in ama’ zi dinga a la dingin na kungah ko ei sawl hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama dingin a mai lei lam nga-in kunsuh a, “Na nasemnu uh pen ka pupa nasemte’ keng silpieh ding sila ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Abigail naw dinin laa tungah a tuong hi; a nasem numei nga in ama a kem hi. Ama nu in David’ nasemte nua zui-in David’ zi-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />David in Jezreel-a Ahinoam zong na kinunpi zo hi; a ni gelin ama’ zi a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in a tanu Michal, David’ zi pen Gallim-a Laish’ tapa Palti tawh na kinungsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ziph-te Gibeah-a Saul kungah a pei vua, “Jeshimon tawh kigalsai Hachilah muol tungah David kiphuol hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul tho a, a kiteel Israel mi tulthum tawh David sui dingin Ziph senel gamah a kuonsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul in Jeshimon tawh kigalsai, lampi gei-a om Hachilah muol tungah giephuol a sat hi. Ahi vangin senel gamah David a omlai hi. Saul in ama a sulzui lam a thei ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in thukante sawl a, Saul a tun tahtah lam a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin David dingin Saul’ giephuol satna munah a pei hi; tuale David in Saul a galkapmangpa Abner tawh a lupna mun a mu hi. Giephuol sungah Saul lumin a kimvelah galkapte in giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Hit-te Ahimelech le Joab’ sanggampa Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai kungah, “Saul’ giephuolah keima tawh a va kuonsuh ding koi na hi vuoi?” a ci hi. Abishai in, “Kei nang tawh hing kuonsuh vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n zanin galkapte kungah David le Abishai a pei uhi; khum sunga giephuolah Saul na kimu a, a khawhlung leilahah a teipi na kiphut hi; tuale ama kimvelah Abner le a galkapte a lum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abishai in David kungah, “Tuni-in Pasien in na khut sungah na galpa ang pie zo ta hi; tua ziehin tu-in teipi-in khatvei beh hing khaw vangin lei tawh hing kiltha vang; ni vei khaw ding kisam lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin David in Abishai kungah, “Ama that sin; bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ sathau nupa tungah a khut hlang poma khielna panin a peng ding na sa amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin, Topa in ama a satlia ding hi; ahi si leh zong a si hun ang tung ding hi; ahi sihle galphuolah va kuonsuhin a si ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ sathau nu pa tungah ka khut ka hlan ding Topa in ei khaam hi; hinanle tu-in a khawhlung a teipi le tuithawl la inlen pei vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in Saul’ khawhlunga teipi le tuithawl la-in a pei uhi. Amate a unpi-un a kimut sieng ziehun koima in mu lo a, koima in zong a thei sih a, koima khat zong a khanglo sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile ama tungah Topa in a kimut uh a suohsah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin David galkhatah galkai a, amate kikal saupi kihalin muol dawnah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in galkapte le Ner’ tapa Abner hlan a, “Abner! Ei dawng lo ding na mah?” a ci hi. Tua bepin Abner in dawngin, “Kumpipa hlan nang koi na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in Abner kungah, “Nang pasal hi lo na mah? Israel sungah nang tawh kibang koi om ahei? Tua ahile bang dinga na pu kumpipa cing lo na hei? Bangzieh ahei cile na pu kumpipa susie dingin mi khat ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam banga na gamtat pen a hoi vawt sih hi. Topa a hing ahi ma bangin a si dinga kilawm na hi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ sathau nu pa ahi na pupa na vil sih hi. Tu-in en in, kumpipa’ teipi le a khawhlunga tuithawl hei-ah a om ei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in David’ awsuo a thei a, “Ka tapa David, tami nang aw amah?” a ci hi. David in, “Ka pupa kumpipa aw, tami keima’ awsuo ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in genbe a, “Bang dingin ka pupa in a nasempa a leisui ahei? Ke’n bang ka bawl ahei? Ka tungah bang khielna om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ka pu kumpipa in a nasempa’ thugente za in. Keima ei do dinga ang hansuo pen Topa ahile ama in ka biehna ei sang taheh; ahi vangin mihingte ahile, Topa mai-ah samsiet thuoh uheh. Azieh pen amate in Topa’ gouluo ka tanhna panin ei notmang vua, ‘Pei inlen, pasien dangte’ na va sem in,’ ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Topa opna panin a kigamla leitang tungah ka sisan kiesah sin; azieh pen muol dawnah vala man dinga mi a kuon bangin thomi bang bep lel kei ei that dingin Israel kumpipa nang kuon hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in, “Ka gamta khiel ta hi; ka ta David aw, hing peikia ta’n, bangzieh ahei cile nangma’ muna-ah ka hinna manpha mama ahi ziehin nang kang bawlsie ngai nawn sih ding hi; kei mimaw ka hi a, khielna lienpi ka bawlkha ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in dawng a, “Tanah na teipi om hi, kumpipa! Tangvalte khat hing peisah inlen hing lasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in mi zosie a dihna le a citahna ziehin thaman a pie hi; bangzieh ahei cile tuni-in Topa in ka khut sungah nangma ei pie a, hinanle Topa’ sathau nu pa tungah ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuni-in ka mitmu-in na hinna a manphat ma bangin keima’ hinna zong Topa’ mitmu-in manpha hinlen gimna zosie panin Topa in nang hing hunkhie taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in David kungah, “Thupha nga ta in, ka tapa David! Nangma in na tampi na sem ding a, tuate na muolsuo ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David ama’ lampi-ah pei a, Saul zong ama’ opna-ah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in a lungsim sungah, “Ni khat ni ciengin Saul’ khutlumin ka si thei kha ding hi; Philistia-te gama tai ding sangin kei adingin a hoizaw bangma om lo hi; tua hile Israel gamgi huom sunga Saul in ei sui den pen ang lungkie ding a, ama’ khut sung panin ka suohta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n David ding a, ama kunga om pasal zaguh tawh Gath kumpipa, Maok’ tapa Achish kungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David, ama le a galkapte tawh, pasal teng zosie a innkuonpite tawh, David, a zi tegel Jezreel-a Ahinoam le Carmel-a Nabal’ zi meigongnu Abigail tawh, Gath-a Achish tawh a tengton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gath ah David tai zo hi, ci Saul kungah a kigen ciengin ama in David sui nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Achish kungah, “Na mitmu-in maipha ka nga leh ka ten thei nading gam sung khuopi khatah mun ei pie in; bang dingin na nasempa nang tawh kumpi khuopi sungah tengton ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni-in Achish in ama tungah Ziklag khuo a pie hi; tua ahi ziehin tua khuo pen tuni dongin Judah kumpite-a’ ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Philistia-te gam sungah David a ten hun kum khat le hla li sung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in David le a mite kuonto-in Geshur-te, Girzi-te, le Amalek-te a sim uhi; azieh ahile tam mite pen Telam -a pan, Shur lampi panin Egypt gam dongin a na tengsate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in khum gam simin pasal hile numei hile khat beh a hinkhawi sih hi. Ahi vangin tuute, bawngte, laate, kalaohte, le puonsilte la-in Achish kungah a peikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Achish in, “Tuni koi va sim ta na hiei?” ci-in a dawh ciengin David in, “Judah-te’ Negeb gam,” ahi sihle, “Jerahmeel-te’ Negeb gam,” ahi sihle, “Ken-te’ Negeb gam,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in, “Amate in i thu teng hing gen va-un, ‘David in tam bangin bawl hi,’ ci kha va uh,” ci-in a ngaisut ziehin David in Gath-a thu tut thei ding popo numei hile pasal hile khat zong a hinkhawi sih hi. Tua khu Philistia-te’ gam sungah a ten hun sung tenga ama’ gamtat zie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Achish in David muong a, “Ama mi Israel-te a si muda thei nadingin ama le ama kibawl zo hi; tua ahi ziehin ama ka nasem ahi zing ding hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Philistia-te in Israel do dingin a galkapte a khawm uhi. Achish in David kungah, “Nangma le na mite, galkapte sungah keima tawh a kuonton ding na hi lam kithei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Achish kungah, “Hoi mama hi, na nasempa in bang bawl thei ahei ci na thei ding hi,” a ci hi. Achish in David kungah, “Hoi mama hi, khan tawntungin kei ei cingpa-in kang koi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Samuel si zo a, ama ziehin Israel zosie a kap vua, ama’ khuopi Ramah ah ama a vui uhi. Saul in a gam sung panin dawilawm neite le bumtawite a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Philistia-te a kikhawm vua, Shunem ah pei-in giephuol a sat uhi. Saul in zong Israel zosie khawm a, Gilboa ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in Philistia galkapte a mu ciengin zau-in a lungsim a linglawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Topa thu a dawh ciengin Topa in a mang tawh hile Urim tawh hile kamsangte tawh hile dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua bepin Saul in a nasemte kungah, “Ama kungah pei-in thu ka dawh thei nadingin dawilawm nei numei khat ei va suipieh ta un,” a ci hi. A nasemte in, “Endor ah dawilawm nei khat a om hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul in a mel selin puon dang sil a, ama le mi ni tawh khum mun a zuon uhi. Zanin amate kungah numei khat a pei hi. Ama in, “A sisa hlate khat tung panin thu ei dawhpieh inlen, nang kungah a min kang law popo ei hlatto pieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua numei in ama kungah, “Saul in a gam sung panin dawilawm neite le bumtawite a hepkhietna thu na thei giagua ahi hi. Tua hi napi bang dinga ka si nading thang ei sie na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle ama kungah Saul kiciem a, Topa a hing ahi ma bangin tam thu ziehin na tungah gimna ang tung vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei in, “Koi pen kang hlatpieh diei?” a ci leh ama in, “Samuel ei hlatpieh in,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numei in Samuel a mu ciengin pengzah pai a, tuale numei in Saul kungah, “Bang dinga nei sol ahiei? Nang Saul na hi vele!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Zau sin, bang ahiei na mu?” a ci hi. Numei in Saul kungah, “Lei pana ang pusuoh hlagau khat ka mu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in tua nu kungah, “A mel puoh dan bang a ci ei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Puvuoi khat ang peito hi; ama in puontuolpi khat sil hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Samuel ahi lam Saul in thei a, a mai tuolah kunin khupbawhin zatahna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Samuel in Saul kungah, “Bang dinga nei hlatto kia-a nei hici buoisah ahei?” a ci hi. Saul in dawng a, “Ka lung a kham mama hi, bangzieh ahei cile Philistia-te in ei simin ka kung panin Pasien a kihemdawh a, kamsangte tawh hile mangte tawh hile ei dawng nawn lo hi; tuaci’n bang bawl ding ka hei, ci ei hil dinga kang hlat ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in, “ Topa in nang ang taisan a, ama na gal suoh zo napi bang dinga kei thu nei dawh lai ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in kei tung tawna ang gensa bangin na tunga ang sem ahi hi; azieh pen Topa in na khut sung panin kumpi gam balkehin na vengpa David pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ thu mang loin Amalek-te tunga ama’ lungthah mama na tawh kizui-in sem lo na hi ziehin tuni-in Topa in nang tunga tam bang ang sep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tham loin Topa in Philistia-te khut sungah nang tawh Israel ang pieton ding hi; tuale zing ciengin kei tawh nang le na tapate i om ton ding uhi. Topa in Philistia-te’ khut sungah Israel galkapte a pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samuel thugen teng ziehin zausi-in thakhatthu-in tuolah Saul a tawnpua pai hi; sun khuo zan khuo bangma a neh lo ziehin a tha a zawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul kungah tua numei pei a, ama a zau seng lam a mu ciengin ama kungah, “Na nasemnu in na thu ka ngai zo hi; ka luong khamin keima kunga nang gen bangin ka bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in nang in zong na nasemnu’ thu ei ngai in; na mai-ah anlum halkhat ei luisah in. Na lampi-ah na pei ciengin na thahat nadingin ne in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in niel a, “Ka ne sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin tua numei tawh kithuo-in a nasemte in a ci teitei uhi; tua bepin ama in a thu uh a mang hi. Tuaci’n lei panin ama tho-in lupna tungah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in tua numei in a inn ah bawngno thau khat nei a, mallang tahin go-in annel la-in meh a, tol saw lo anlum a em hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua nu in Saul le a nasemte mai-ah lui a, tuale amate in a ne uhi. Tua ciengin khum zanin amate dingin a peikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Philistia-te in a galkap zosie uh Aphek ah a khawmtuo vua, Israel-te in Jezreel-a tuikhuh gei-ah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia uliente a tul tul, a za za-in a kizawt laitahun David le a mite zong Achish tawh a nua lamah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Philistia galkapmangte in, “Tami Hebrew-te tam muna bang bawl ahi uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Achish in Philistia galkapmangte kungah, “Tampa, ni tampi le kum tampi keima tawh a omton Israel kumpi Saul’ nasempa David hi lo amah? Ka kunga ang tai-a kipan tuni cieng dongin ama tungah khielna ka mu sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle ama tungah Philistia galkapmangte a lungthah uhi; tuale Philistia galkapmangte in, “Na koina munah a kilekia thei nadingin tua mipa peisahkia in; gal kidona sungah eite tawh ama a kuonton sih ding hi, tua ahi sihle gal kidona sungah i langin ang pangkha ding hi. Azieh pen tam mipa in a pupa tawh kilemna bangci bawl thei ding ahei? Tam sunga om mite’ lutangte tawh a bawl ding hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tampa khu, ‘Saul in a tulin that, David in a tul sawmin that,’ ci-a amate khatlekhat a lam kawmun la a tap pa uh David hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Achish in David hlanin ama kungah, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin nang na thuman a, gal sungah kei tawh na kuonton na tunton ding man ka sa hi; azieh pen keima kunga nang tun ni-a kipan tuni dongin na tungah khielna bangma ka mu sih hi. Hinanle uliente in nang ang dei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in kilekia in; hlamuong tahin pei ta’n; Philistia uliente lung himaw nading bangma bawl da mai in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Achish kungah, “Bang ahiei ka bawl? Ka pu kumpipa’ galte do-in ka pei thei lo nadingin na nasem dinga kang lut ni-a kipan tuni dongin na nasempa tungah bang mu na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Achish in David dawngkia a, “Keima’ muna-ah nang pen Pasien’ vantungmi khat bangin kaw baanglo na hina thu ka thei hi; hinanle Philistia galkapmangte in, ‘Eihaw tawh gal kidona sungah ama ang kuonto sih ding hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin tu-in nang zawpi na pupa’ nasemte tawh zingmawngin thobai unlen, note adinga ka koisa munah pei un,” a ci hi. Ka mai-ah hoitahin sem zo na hi ziehin, thu hoi lo kigente tawh kisai-in lung himawna-in nei sin. Zingmawng a kipan thobai unlen, khuova behin kihem pai ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Philistia gama kilekia dingin a mite tawh David zingmawng phalvahin dingkhie a, hinanle Jezreel-ah Philistia-te a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in a ni thum ni-in Ziglak ah David le a mite a tun ciengun, Amalek-te in Negeb le Ziklag sim zo uhi. Amate in Ziklag simin mei tawh a haltum vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />numeite le a sunga om mi zosie , a lien a neu-in a man uhi; amate khat zong a that sih vua, ahi vangin a peina vuah amate a zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuopi sungah David le a mite a tun ciengun mei tawh tua khuopi a kihaltum a mu vua, a zite ule a tanu a tapate uh salin a kimat siengna thu a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin a thazawt dongun David le a zawpi mite awngin kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David’ zi tegel, Jezreel-a Ahinoam le Carmel-a Nabal’ zi meigongnu Abigail zong salin kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David nahpi-in a lungkham hi; azieh pen mi zosie in a tanute ule a tapate uh ziehin a lungsim uh kisie a, suong tawh selia ding a gen uhi. Ahi vangin Topa a Pasien in David a thakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Ahimelech’ tapa siempu Abiathar kungah, “Siempupuon hing peipi in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Abiathar in David kungah siempipuon a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in zong Topa thu dong a, “Tam mihonte ka del diei mah? Amate ka pha zo na diei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Del in; bangzieh ahei cile amate na nuaphah valon ding a, na hunkhie zo tahtah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n David le a zawpi galkap zaguh tawh kuonin a kinuasie mite’ giena Besor Lui-ah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle David in a del peisuoh hi; ama le mi zali ahi uhi; Besor Lui galkai dinga a gim seng mi zani a kinuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in gamlahah Egypt-te khat mu-in David kungah a peipi uhi. Amate in ama an a pie vua, ama in an ne-in dawn ding tui zong a pie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate in theiga tawh a kibawl moh themkhat le lengga kiphogaw bawh ni zong a pie uhi. Ama in a neh zaw ciengin a tha a dimkia hi; azieh pen ni thum le zan thum sung an le tui ciem lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in ama kungah, “Nang koite na hiei? Nang hei pan na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Amalek-te khat’ nasem ka hi a, Egypt tangval khat ka hi hi. Tu masang ni thum lai-in ka cina ahi ziehin ka pupa in ei nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kote in zong Chereth-te’ Negeb gam, Judah-te’ gam le Caleb-te’ gam ka sim uhi; tuale Ziklag mei tawh ka hal uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Tam galsim pawl kungah nei zawpisuh diei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Kei nei tha lo nading ahi a, ka pupa’ khut sunga nei ap lo nading ahi zongin Pasien’ minin kei tungah hing kiciem in. Tua hile amate kungah kang zawpisuh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a zawpisuh ciengin Philistia-te gam le Judah gam pana a galvan lahte uh a tam seng ziehin mun zosie-ah kithethangin an ne tui dawnin lamin a na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in zingmawng phalvah panin a zingni nitah dongin sim a, kalaoh tung tuonga a taimang tangval zali simlo amate lahah khat zong suohta lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in Amalek-te in a lahsa van zosie lahpiehkia a, a zi tegel zong hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lien a neu, tanu tapate hile galvan kilate ahi sihle a kitomgam na khat popo hile khat zong pelam lo hi; David in a unpi-in a peipikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in ganhing dangte masanga kihawi bawnghon, keelhon le ganhon zosie zong man sieng hi; mite in, “Tami khu David’ galvan lahte ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a gim seng ziehun David nua a zui zo lo, Besor Lui-ah a kinuasie mi zanite kungah David a tung hi. David le a zawpi mite dawn dingin amate a kuon vua, David in mite kung a tun ciengin amate a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin David tawh a zawhton pasalte lahah migilo le kimanna a nei lo mi zosie in, “Eite tawh hing peisuoh lo uh ahi ziein, pasal khat ciet in a zite le a tate zawpi-in a peipi ding ci simlo i lahpieh uh vante bangma khat zong amate i pie sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin David in, “Sanggamte aw, Topa in ei piehsa nate tua bangin na bawl sih ding uhi; ama in eite ei hinkhawi a, i khut sung vuah ei bulu dinga ang kuon mihonte ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami thu-ah koi in na thugen uh ang mang mawh ding ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile galkuonpa’ tanh za ma, phuol ngahpa in zong tang ding hi; amate in a kibangin a tang ciet ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khum ni-a kipanin tuni dongin ama in Israel adingin thukham le biehna ngaina kipin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ziklag ah David a tun ciengin ama in a na lahte pawlkhat Judah upa a guolte kungah hlah a, “ Topa’ galvan kilate sung pan noma dinga letsong kang puoh ahi hi,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua i van teng pen Bethel-te ading, Negeb gama Ramoth-te ading, le Jattirte ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer-te ading, Siphmoth-te ading , Eshtemoa-te’ khuopite ading ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Racal-te ading, Jerahmeel-te’ khuopite ading, le Ken-te’ khuopite ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hormah, Bor-ashan, Athach-a omte ading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron-a omte ading, le David le a mite pei ngaina muncin tenga mite ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Philistia-te in Israel a sim uhi; tuale Philistia-te mai-ah Israel mite a taimang vua, Gilboa Muol tungah tampitah a puamat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Philistia-te in Saul le a tapate a nuaphah uhi; tuale Philistia-te in Saul’ tapate ahi Jonathan, Abinadab le Malchishua a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gal in Saul nahpitahin a neh hi; thalkapte’ thaltang in ama kha-in nah liem mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul in a galvan puopa kungah, “Tam tep tan lote ang pei-in ei dawtlia vua, apmaina-in ei nei lo nadingun na namsau dawh inlen ei dawtlia ta’n,” a ci hi. Hizongle tua galvan puopa in a bawl nuom sih hi; azieh pen ama a cimul a tho hi. Tuaci’n Saul in ama’ namsau la-in tua nam dawn tungah puasuhin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A galvan puopa in Saul si a mu bepin ama zong a namsau tungah puasuhin ama tawh a siton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Saul le ama’ tapa thum teng le a galvan puopa le ama mi zosie nikhat thu-in a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezreel kuom galkhat le Jordan galkhata om Israel mite in Israel mite taimangin Saul le a tapate kithat zo hi, ci a zah ciengun a khuopite uh nuasie-in a tai uhi; tuale Philistia-te pei-in tua khuopite a luo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing ni-in misite’ puon hawhkhie dingin a kuon ciengun Saul le a tapa thum’ luong kilawmlia a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul’ lu tanin a galhiem a hawhkhe vua, a milimte’ opna innte le mite kungah tam lungdamna thu a puoh dingin Philistia gam sung mun zosie-ah kamtaite a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in Astarte biehinn sungah a galhiemte a koi uhi; tuale amate in Beth-shan kulbangah a lu a khai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jabesh-gilead mite in Saul tunga Philistia-te bawldan a zah ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />galhang pasal zosie a ding vua, tuaci’n zan tungtawnin pei-in Beth-shan kulbang panin Saul le a tapate’ luong a la uhi. Amate Jabeshah tungin tua munah a haltum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a gute la-in Jabesh-a makeng kung nei-ah vui-in ni sagi sung an a tang uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
